      "values:originalText": "(1) A medical device complies, for the purposes of this Chapter\n(including Part 4-11), with the essential principles if and only if it\ndoes not contravene any of the essential principles.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A medical device complies, for the purposes of this Chapter\n(including Part 4-11), with the essential principles if and only if it\ndoes not contravene any of the essential principles.",
      "values:partOf": {
