    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41BI(2) Meaning of non-application of conformity assessment",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41bi-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, for the purposes of this Chapter (other than Part 4-11),\nsubsection (1) does not apply if:\n(a) the quality management system applied in the manufacture of\nthe medical device complies with one or more conformity\nassessment standards that apply to it; and\n(b) the contravention is only in respect of a part or parts of the\nrequirement to which that conformity assessment standard, or\none or more of those conformity assessment standards, relate.\n41BIB  Overseas regulators",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, for the purposes of this Chapter (other than Part 4-11),\nsubsection (1) does not apply if:\n(a) the quality management system applied in the manufacture of\nthe medical device complies with one or more conformity\nassessment standards that apply to it; and\n(b) the contravention is only in respect of a part or parts of the\nrequirement to which that conformity assessment standard, or\none or more of those conformity assessment standards, relate.\n41BIB  Overseas regulators",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2aa38e29c6f814ca7e871fb2caa6b3948b8b56506221cdd313191405de04a813",
      "skos:note": "The Secretary may determine a body for the purposes of subsection (1). Exemptions from conformity assessment requirements"
    },
    {
