      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), the Secretary may determine a\nbody by reference to a designation, recognition, approval or\nauthorisation (however described) of the body:\n(a) by one or more countries; or\n(b) by another body.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Without limiting subsection (2), the Secretary may determine a\nbody by reference to a designation, recognition, approval or\nauthorisation (however described) of the body:\n(a) by one or more countries; or\n(b) by another body.\nNote:\nFor specification by class, see subsection 13(3) of the Legislation Act\n2003.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41bi-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0d9ee7fe0e166737c14ac656758a1e8315c0b2d9368bce683b141437cb3d7520",
      "skos:note": "A conformity assessment standard only applies to specified parts of procedures. The Secretary may determine a body by reference to a designation, recognition, approval or authorization."
    },
