    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41cd",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41CD Inconsistencies between medical device standards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41cd"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.35",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A medical device standard that:\n(a) applies to a kind of medical device; and\n(b) is inconsistent with another medical device standard that\napplies only to some of the devices of that kind;\nis, to the extent of the inconsistency, of no effect in relation to the\ndevices referred to in paragraph (b).\n(2) A medical device standard that applies to a kind of medical device\nthat consists of a combination of component parts takes precedence\nover any medical device standard that applies to the component\nparts.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A medical device standard that:\n(a) applies to a kind of medical device; and\n(b) is inconsistent with another medical device standard that\napplies only to some of the devices of that kind;\nis, to the extent of the inconsistency, of no effect in relation to the\ndevices referred to in paragraph (b).\n(2) A medical device standard that applies to a kind of medical device\nthat consists of a combination of component parts takes precedence\nover any medical device standard that applies to the component\nparts.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41cd-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41cd-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "33f88249a6fc79b87535bee6dcdfb8198d91e8939fc3be6cdaa9ec788057487a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41cd",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41CD Inconsistencies between medical device standards",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 35,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A medical device standard that:\n(a) applies to a kind of medical device; and\n(b) is inconsistent with another medical device standard that\napplies only to some of the devices of that kind;\nis, to the extent of the inconsistency, of no effect in relation to the\ndevices referred to in paragraph (b).\n(2) A medical device standard that applies to a kind of medical device\nthat consists of a combination of component parts takes precedence\nover any medical device standard that applies to the component\nparts.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices"
    },
    {
