      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) applies to a kind of medical device; and (b) is inconsistent with another medical device standard that\napplies only to some of the devices of that kind;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "is, to the extent of the inconsistency, of no effect in relation to the\ndevices referred to in paragraph (b)."
    },
