    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ed",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41ED Time for making decisions on applications",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ed"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "If the application relates to the issuing of a conformity assessment\ncertificate in relation to which a period has been prescribed under\nparagraph 63(2)(dc), a decision on the application must be made\nwithin that period, unless the application lapses under\nsection 41EG.",
      "skos:definition": "If the application relates to the issuing of a conformity assessment\ncertificate in relation to which a period has been prescribed under\nparagraph 63(2)(dc), a decision on the application must be made\nwithin that period, unless the application lapses under\nsection 41EG.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ed-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ed-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f780d6beb45a45183421d233eaedb0e1dca61a4e6216564bee9edc5c9513b56c",
      "skos:note": "Decision on application must be made within a prescribed period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ed",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41ED Time for making decisions on applications",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 49,
      "values:originalText": "If the application relates to the issuing of a conformity assessment\ncertificate in relation to which a period has been prescribed under\nparagraph 63(2)(dc), a decision on the application must be made\nwithin that period, unless the application lapses under\nsection 41EG."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ed-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ed"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ed-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must provide decision within prescribed period.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ee",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41EE Procedure following making a decision whether to issue",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ee"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "certificate\n(1) After making a decision whether to issue a conformity assessment\ncertificate, the Secretary must:\n(a) notify the applicant in writing of his or her decision within 20\nworking days; and\n(b) if the decision is not to issue the certificate—state in the\nnotice the reasons for the decision; and\n(c) if the decision is to issue the certificate and all assessment\nfees that are due and payable for the application have been\npaid:\n(i) issue the certificate to the manufacturer in relation to\nwhom the application was made; and\n(ii) give the applicant a copy of the certificate (if the\napplicant is not the manufacturer).\n(2) A conformity assessment certificate must specify whether it\ncovers:\n(a) all medical devices manufactured by the manufacturer; or\n(b) only specified medical devices manufactured by the\nmanufacturer.\n(3) A conformity assessment certificate must contain any other\ninformation prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this\nsubsection.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "certificate\n(1) After making a decision whether to issue a conformity assessment\ncertificate, the Secretary must:\n(a) notify the applicant in writing of his or her decision within 20\nworking days; and\n(b) if the decision is not to issue the certificate—state in the\nnotice the reasons for the decision; and\n(c) if the decision is to issue the certificate and all assessment\nfees that are due and payable for the application have been\npaid:\n(i) issue the certificate to the manufacturer in relation to\nwhom the application was made; and\n(ii) give the applicant a copy of the certificate (if the\napplicant is not the manufacturer).\n(2) A conformity assessment certificate must specify whether it\ncovers:\n(a) all medical devices manufactured by the manufacturer; or\n(b) only specified medical devices manufactured by the\nmanufacturer.\n(3) A conformity assessment certificate must contain any other\ninformation prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this\nsubsection.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ee-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ee-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ee-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "03d66dd08835c1ca3f128cceacd1f31ac94163096b20f445ae84285bc0832d72"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ee",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41EE Procedure following making a decision whether to issue",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 49,
      "values:originalText": "certificate\n(1) After making a decision whether to issue a conformity assessment\ncertificate, the Secretary must:\n(a) notify the applicant in writing of his or her decision within 20\nworking days; and\n(b) if the decision is not to issue the certificate—state in the\nnotice the reasons for the decision; and\n(c) if the decision is to issue the certificate and all assessment\nfees that are due and payable for the application have been\npaid:\n(i) issue the certificate to the manufacturer in relation to\nwhom the application was made; and\n(ii) give the applicant a copy of the certificate (if the\napplicant is not the manufacturer).\n(2) A conformity assessment certificate must specify whether it\ncovers:\n(a) all medical devices manufactured by the manufacturer; or\n(b) only specified medical devices manufactured by the\nmanufacturer.\n(3) A conformity assessment certificate must contain any other\ninformation prescribed by the regulations for the purposes of this\nsubsection.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ee-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41EE(1) Procedure following making a decision whether to issue",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ee-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
