      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.49",
      "values:originalText": "(1) After making a decision whether to issue a conformity assessment\ncertificate, the Secretary must:\n(a) notify the applicant in writing of his or her decision within 20\nworking days; and\n(b) if the decision is not to issue the certificate—state in the\nnotice the reasons for the decision; and\n(c) if the decision is to issue the certificate and all assessment\nfees that are due and payable for the application have been\npaid:\n(i) issue the certificate to the manufacturer in relation to\nwhom the application was made; and\n(ii) give the applicant a copy of the certificate (if the\napplicant is not the manufacturer).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) After making a decision whether to issue a conformity assessment\ncertificate, the Secretary must:\n(a) notify the applicant in writing of his or her decision within 20\nworking days; and\n(b) if the decision is not to issue the certificate—state in the\nnotice the reasons for the decision; and\n(c) if the decision is to issue the certificate and all assessment\nfees that are due and payable for the application have been\npaid:\n(i) issue the certificate to the manufacturer in relation to\nwhom the application was made; and\n(ii) give the applicant a copy of the certificate (if the\napplicant is not the manufacturer).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ee"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ee-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ee-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0242e559c47ebc263dc8c15a458cc1944e74bf6ad82449df3fdea656dbfde880",
      "skos:note": "Secretary must notify applicant of decision within 20 working days.",
      "dc:description": "Reasons for decision if not issuing certificate."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ee-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41EE(1) Procedure following making a decision whether to issue",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 49,
      "values:originalText": "(1) After making a decision whether to issue a conformity assessment\ncertificate, the Secretary must:\n(a) notify the applicant in writing of his or her decision within 20\nworking days; and\n(b) if the decision is not to issue the certificate—state in the\nnotice the reasons for the decision; and\n(c) if the decision is to issue the certificate and all assessment\nfees that are due and payable for the application have been\npaid:\n(i) issue the certificate to the manufacturer in relation to\nwhom the application was made; and\n(ii) give the applicant a copy of the certificate (if the\napplicant is not the manufacturer)."
    },
