    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ef-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41EF(6) Duration of certificate",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ef-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Secretary:\n(a) must give notice of an extension to the manufacturer in\nrelation to whom the certificate was issued; and\n(b) may give notice of an extension to the applicant for the\ncertificate (if the applicant is not the manufacturer).",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The Secretary:\n(a) must give notice of an extension to the manufacturer in\nrelation to whom the certificate was issued; and\n(b) may give notice of an extension to the applicant for the\ncertificate (if the applicant is not the manufacturer).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ef"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ef-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ef-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "261258a93c6211fd9182d8f49c27388cb8c4cc26ab298512e1a435bb9ce7c667",
      "skos:note": "Secretary must give notice of extension to manufacturer and applicant.",
      "dc:description": "Notice"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ef-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41EF(6) Duration of certificate",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 50,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Secretary:\n(a) must give notice of an extension to the manufacturer in\nrelation to whom the certificate was issued; and\n(b) may give notice of an extension to the applicant for the\ncertificate (if the applicant is not the manufacturer)."
    },
    {
