      "cml:conclusionText": "(1) The suspension takes effect:\n(a) if the notice under section 41EM states that the suspension is\nnecessary to prevent imminent risk of death, serious illness or\nserious injury—on the day on which the notice is given to the\nperson; or\n(b) in any other case—on the day specified for the purpose in the\nnotice, being a day not earlier than 20 working days after the\nnotice is given to the person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eo-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41EO(2) Duration of suspension",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41eo-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The suspension has effect until:\n(a) the Secretary revokes it under section 41EP; or\n(b) the expiry of:\n(i) the period specified in the notice under section 41EM;\nor\n(ii) if the period is extended under subsection (3) of this\nsection, the period as so extended.\nNote:\nUnless a suspension of a conformity assessment certificate has been\nrevoked, the certificate is automatically revoked: see section 41ER.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The suspension has effect until:\n(a) the Secretary revokes it under section 41EP; or\n(b) the expiry of:\n(i) the period specified in the notice under section 41EM;\nor\n(ii) if the period is extended under subsection (3) of this\nsection, the period as so extended.\nNote:\nUnless a suspension of a conformity assessment certificate has been\nrevoked, the certificate is automatically revoked: see section 41ER.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eo"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eo-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "005ef4878063ee027effe5153ca5a509d46abe14f014db52388b91eaa0190b06",
      "skos:note": "Suspension duration"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41eo-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41EO(2) Duration of suspension",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The suspension has effect until:\n(a) the Secretary revokes it under section 41EP; or\n(b) the expiry of:\n(i) the period specified in the notice under section 41EM;\nor\n(ii) if the period is extended under subsection (3) of this\nsection, the period as so extended.\nNote:\nUnless a suspension of a conformity assessment certificate has been\nrevoked, the certificate is automatically revoked: see section 41ER."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eo-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eo-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eo-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41EO(3) Duration of suspension",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41eo-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If a person in relation to whom a kind of medical device is\nincluded in the Register shows that he or she has taken steps to\naddress the grounds for revoking the certificate under\nsection 41ET, the Secretary may, by written notice given to the\nperson, extend the period specified in the notice under\nsection 41EM by a further specified period not exceeding 6\nmonths.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If a person in relation to whom a kind of medical device is\nincluded in the Register shows that he or she has taken steps to\naddress the grounds for revoking the certificate under\nsection 41ET, the Secretary may, by written notice given to the\nperson, extend the period specified in the notice under\nsection 41EM by a further specified period not exceeding 6\nmonths.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eo"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eo-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b31346b6564c4702e2b0e14558620baca520515253cad055ff58ceba9d63a02c",
      "skos:note": "Extension of period for addressing grounds for revoking medical device certificate"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41eo-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41EO(3) Duration of suspension",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If a person in relation to whom a kind of medical device is\nincluded in the Register shows that he or she has taken steps to\naddress the grounds for revoking the certificate under\nsection 41ET, the Secretary may, by written notice given to the\nperson, extend the period specified in the notice under\nsection 41EM by a further specified period not exceeding 6\nmonths."
    },
