      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary must revoke the suspension if the Secretary is\nsatisfied that:\n(a) the ground on which the conformity assessment certificate\nwas suspended no longer applies; and\n(b) there are no other grounds for suspending the certificate.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Secretary must revoke the suspension if the Secretary is\nsatisfied that:\n(a) the ground on which the conformity assessment certificate\nwas suspended no longer applies; and\n(b) there are no other grounds for suspending the certificate.",
