      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The Secretary must revoke the suspension if the Secretary is satisfied that: (a) the ground on which the conformity assessment certificate was suspended no longer applies; and (b) there are no other grounds for suspending the certificate.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Revocation obligation applies between specified temporal intervals"
