      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "unaffected\n(1) This Division does not affect the Secretary’s powers to revoke a\nconformity assessment certificate under Division 4.\n(2) To the extent that a suspension under this Division relates to a\nconformity assessment certificate to which such a revocation\nrelates, the suspension ceases to have effect.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nConformity assessment certificates  Part 4-4\nRevocation of conformity assessment certificates  Division 4\nSection 41ER\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "skos:definition": "unaffected\n(1) This Division does not affect the Secretary’s powers to revoke a\nconformity assessment certificate under Division 4.\n(2) To the extent that a suspension under this Division relates to a\nconformity assessment certificate to which such a revocation\nrelates, the suspension ceases to have effect.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nConformity assessment certificates  Part 4-4\nRevocation of conformity assessment certificates  Division 4\nSection 41ER\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eq-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eq-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7298a246841d9715feeba96a04bba28f224a6389c22f90f89e3bf1c64f9bb7bc"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41eq",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41EQ Powers of revocation of conformity assessment certificates",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "unaffected\n(1) This Division does not affect the Secretary’s powers to revoke a\nconformity assessment certificate under Division 4.\n(2) To the extent that a suspension under this Division relates to a\nconformity assessment certificate to which such a revocation\nrelates, the suspension ceases to have effect.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nConformity assessment certificates  Part 4-4\nRevocation of conformity assessment certificates  Division 4\nSection 41ER\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eq-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41EQ(1) Powers of revocation of conformity assessment certificates",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41eq-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
