    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eu",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41EU Limiting revocation of conformity assessment certificates to",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41eu"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "some medical devices of a particular kind\n(1) If the Secretary is satisfied that the ground for revoking a\nconformity assessment certificate applies only to:\n(a) some of the kinds of medical devices to which the certificate\napplies; or\n(b) some medical devices of the kinds to which the certificate\napplies;\nthe Secretary must limit the revocation to the medical devices to\nwhich that ground or any other ground for revocation applies.\n(2) If the revocation of the certificate is so limited, the Secretary must\nvary the certificate so that it no longer applies to the medical\ndevices referred to in subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "some medical devices of a particular kind\n(1) If the Secretary is satisfied that the ground for revoking a\nconformity assessment certificate applies only to:\n(a) some of the kinds of medical devices to which the certificate\napplies; or\n(b) some medical devices of the kinds to which the certificate\napplies;\nthe Secretary must limit the revocation to the medical devices to\nwhich that ground or any other ground for revocation applies.\n(2) If the revocation of the certificate is so limited, the Secretary must\nvary the certificate so that it no longer applies to the medical\ndevices referred to in subsection (1).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eu-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41eu-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f8519e4b3a4e40ca9f6ff3212c99befe3a76e760cbb9726a60472c01aa2b5ba4"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41eu",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41EU Limiting revocation of conformity assessment certificates to",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "some medical devices of a particular kind\n(1) If the Secretary is satisfied that the ground for revoking a\nconformity assessment certificate applies only to:\n(a) some of the kinds of medical devices to which the certificate\napplies; or\n(b) some medical devices of the kinds to which the certificate\napplies;\nthe Secretary must limit the revocation to the medical devices to\nwhich that ground or any other ground for revocation applies.\n(2) If the revocation of the certificate is so limited, the Secretary must\nvary the certificate so that it no longer applies to the medical\ndevices referred to in subsection (1)."
    },
    {
