      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.73",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person may make an application to the Secretary for a kind of\nmedical device to be included in the Register.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person may make an application to the Secretary for a kind of\nmedical device to be included in the Register.",
