    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fc-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41FC(2) Making an application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41fc-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.73",
      "values:originalText": "(2) An application must not contain information that is false or\nmisleading in a material particular.\nNote:\nA person might also commit an offence, or contravene a civil penalty\nprovision, if the person makes a statement in an application that is\nfalse or misleading in a material particular: see sections 41FE and\n41FEA.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An application must not contain information that is false or\nmisleading in a material particular.\nNote:\nA person might also commit an offence, or contravene a civil penalty\nprovision, if the person makes a statement in an application that is\nfalse or misleading in a material particular: see sections 41FE and\n41FEA.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fc"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
