      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.73",
      "values:originalText": "The applicant must certify that:\n(a) devices of the kind in question are medical devices; and\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "The applicant must certify that:\n(a) devices of the kind in question are medical devices; and\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
