      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.78",
      "values:originalText": "(6) An offence against subsection (5) is an offence of strict liability.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(6) An offence against subsection (5) is an offence of strict liability.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
