    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ff",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41FF Obligation to include kinds of medical devices in the Register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ff"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n(a) an application for a kind of medical device to be included in\nthe Register in relation to a person has passed preliminary\nassessment; and\n(b) the application has not been selected for audit under\nsection 41FH;\nthe Secretary must include the kind of device in the Register in\nrelation to the person.\n(1A) However, the Secretary must not include the kind of device in the\nRegister in relation to the person if the Secretary is satisfied that\nthe kind of device is to be used exclusively for one or more of the\npurposes specified under section 41BEA.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Part 4-5\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Division 1\nSection 41FG\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(2) As soon as practicable after the kind of device has been included in\nthe Register, the Secretary must make available to the applicant a\ncertificate of the inclusion of the kind of device in the Register.\n(3) The certificate must specify the day on which the inclusion of the\nkind of device in the Register commences.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n(a) an application for a kind of medical device to be included in\nthe Register in relation to a person has passed preliminary\nassessment; and\n(b) the application has not been selected for audit under\nsection 41FH;\nthe Secretary must include the kind of device in the Register in\nrelation to the person.\n(1A) However, the Secretary must not include the kind of device in the\nRegister in relation to the person if the Secretary is satisfied that\nthe kind of device is to be used exclusively for one or more of the\npurposes specified under section 41BEA.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Part 4-5\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Division 1\nSection 41FG\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(2) As soon as practicable after the kind of device has been included in\nthe Register, the Secretary must make available to the applicant a\ncertificate of the inclusion of the kind of device in the Register.\n(3) The certificate must specify the day on which the inclusion of the\nkind of device in the Register commences.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ff-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ff-ss-1a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ff-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ff-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "56d4f2c7ee75c5f82b32f780beed336756dad551616318537309eea5dcfc747f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ff",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41FF Obligation to include kinds of medical devices in the Register",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 80,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n(a) an application for a kind of medical device to be included in\nthe Register in relation to a person has passed preliminary\nassessment; and\n(b) the application has not been selected for audit under\nsection 41FH;\nthe Secretary must include the kind of device in the Register in\nrelation to the person.\n(1A) However, the Secretary must not include the kind of device in the\nRegister in relation to the person if the Secretary is satisfied that\nthe kind of device is to be used exclusively for one or more of the\npurposes specified under section 41BEA.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Part 4-5\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Division 1\nSection 41FG\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(2) As soon as practicable after the kind of device has been included in\nthe Register, the Secretary must make available to the applicant a\ncertificate of the inclusion of the kind of device in the Register.\n(3) The certificate must specify the day on which the inclusion of the\nkind of device in the Register commences."
    },
