      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "(2) As soon as practicable after the kind of device has been included in\nthe Register, the Secretary must make available to the applicant a\ncertificate of the inclusion of the kind of device in the Register.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) As soon as practicable after the kind of device has been included in\nthe Register, the Secretary must make available to the applicant a\ncertificate of the inclusion of the kind of device in the Register.",
