      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.82",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Secretary must decide not to include the kind of device to\nwhich the application relates in the Register if the Secretary is not\nso satisfied.\n41FIA  Certificates issued by Australian conformity assessment\nbodies",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Secretary must decide not to include the kind of device to\nwhich the application relates in the Register if the Secretary is not\nso satisfied.\n41FIA  Certificates issued by Australian conformity assessment\nbodies",
