      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.86",
      "values:originalText": "If a kind of medical device is included in the Register, the\nSecretary is to assign a unique device number to it.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Part 4-5\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Division 1\nSection 41FM\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "skos:definition": "If a kind of medical device is included in the Register, the\nSecretary is to assign a unique device number to it.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Part 4-5\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Division 1\nSection 41FM\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "cml:asserts": [
