      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.88",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The inclusion of a kind of medical device in the Register is subject\nto a condition that the person in relation to whom the kind of\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Part 4-5\nConditions  Division 2\nSection 41FN\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\ndevice is included in the Register will deliver a reasonable number\nof samples of the kind of device if the Secretary so requests:\n(a) within the period specified in the request; and\n(b) in accordance with any other requirements specified in the\nrequest.\nThe period specified in the request must include at least 10\nworking days.\nAvailability etc. of information",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The inclusion of a kind of medical device in the Register is subject\nto a condition that the person in relation to whom the kind of\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nIncluding medical devices in the Register  Part 4-5\nConditions  Division 2\nSection 41FN\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\ndevice is included in the Register will deliver a reasonable number\nof samples of the kind of device if the Secretary so requests:\n(a) within the period specified in the request; and\n(b) in accordance with any other requirements specified in the\nrequest.\nThe period specified in the request must include at least 10\nworking days.\nAvailability etc. of information",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fn"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fn-ss-2-norm"
        },
