    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fn-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41FN(3) Conditions applying automatically",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41fn-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.88",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The inclusion of a kind of medical device in the Register is subject\nto conditions that:\n(a) at all times while the inclusion in the Register has effect, the\nperson in relation to whom the kind of device is included in\nthe Register:\n(i) has available sufficient information to substantiate\ncompliance with the essential principles; or\n(ii) has procedures in place, including a written agreement\nwith the manufacturer of the kind of device, to ensure\nthat such information can be obtained from the\nmanufacturer within 20 working days; and\n(b) at all times while the inclusion in the Register has effect, the\nperson in relation to whom the kind of device is included in\nthe Register:\n(i) has available sufficient information to substantiate that\nthe conformity assessment procedures have been\napplied to the kind of medical device or that\nrequirements, comparable to those procedures, have\nbeen applied to the kind of medical device to the\nsatisfaction of an overseas regulator; or\n(ii) has procedures in place, including a written agreement\nwith the manufacturer of the kind of device, to ensure\nthat such information can be obtained from the\nmanufacturer within 20 working days; and\n(ba) at all times while the inclusion in the Register has effect, the\nperson in relation to whom the kind of device is included in\nthe Register:\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The inclusion of a kind of medical device in the Register is subject\nto conditions that:\n(a) at all times while the inclusion in the Register has effect, the\nperson in relation to whom the kind of device is included in\nthe Register:\n(i) has available sufficient information to substantiate\ncompliance with the essential principles; or\n(ii) has procedures in place, including a written agreement\nwith the manufacturer of the kind of device, to ensure\nthat such information can be obtained from the\nmanufacturer within 20 working days; and\n(b) at all times while the inclusion in the Register has effect, the\nperson in relation to whom the kind of device is included in\nthe Register:\n(i) has available sufficient information to substantiate that\nthe conformity assessment procedures have been\napplied to the kind of medical device or that\nrequirements, comparable to those procedures, have\nbeen applied to the kind of medical device to the\nsatisfaction of an overseas regulator; or\n(ii) has procedures in place, including a written agreement\nwith the manufacturer of the kind of device, to ensure\nthat such information can be obtained from the\nmanufacturer within 20 working days; and\n(ba) at all times while the inclusion in the Register has effect, the\nperson in relation to whom the kind of device is included in\nthe Register:\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fn"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fn-ss-3-norm"
        },
