    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fo",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41FO Conditions imposed when kinds of medical devices are",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41fo"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.91",
      "values:originalText": "included in the Register\n(1) If the Secretary includes a kind of medical device in the Register in\nrelation to a person, the Secretary may, in writing, impose\nconditions on the inclusion of the kind of device in the Register.\n(2) Conditions referred to in subsection (1) may relate to:\n(a) manufacture of devices of that kind; or\n(b) custody, intended purpose, supply, disposal or destruction of\ndevices of that kind; or\n(c) keeping of records relating to devices of that kind, including\nrecords relating to the tracking and location of devices of that\nkind after their supply; or\n(d) matters dealt with in, or matters additional to matters dealt\nwith in, the essential principles; or\n(e) such other matters relating to devices of that kind as the\nSecretary thinks appropriate.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "included in the Register\n(1) If the Secretary includes a kind of medical device in the Register in\nrelation to a person, the Secretary may, in writing, impose\nconditions on the inclusion of the kind of device in the Register.\n(2) Conditions referred to in subsection (1) may relate to:\n(a) manufacture of devices of that kind; or\n(b) custody, intended purpose, supply, disposal or destruction of\ndevices of that kind; or\n(c) keeping of records relating to devices of that kind, including\nrecords relating to the tracking and location of devices of that\nkind after their supply; or\n(d) matters dealt with in, or matters additional to matters dealt\nwith in, the essential principles; or\n(e) such other matters relating to devices of that kind as the\nSecretary thinks appropriate.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fo-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41fo-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "75859b98e655040e4d3a3e95b01a30a97cf5e98446251a6e9be43cec5722c760"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41fo",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41FO Conditions imposed when kinds of medical devices are",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 91,
      "values:originalText": "included in the Register\n(1) If the Secretary includes a kind of medical device in the Register in\nrelation to a person, the Secretary may, in writing, impose\nconditions on the inclusion of the kind of device in the Register.\n(2) Conditions referred to in subsection (1) may relate to:\n(a) manufacture of devices of that kind; or\n(b) custody, intended purpose, supply, disposal or destruction of\ndevices of that kind; or\n(c) keeping of records relating to devices of that kind, including\nrecords relating to the tracking and location of devices of that\nkind after their supply; or\n(d) matters dealt with in, or matters additional to matters dealt\nwith in, the essential principles; or\n(e) such other matters relating to devices of that kind as the\nSecretary thinks appropriate.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices"
    },
