      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.92",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of paragraphs (2)(aa) and (ab), the earlier day\nmust not be earlier than the day the notice is given to the person.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nSuspension and cancellation from the Register  Part 4-6\nSuspension from the Register  Division 1\nSection 41G\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of paragraphs (2)(aa) and (ab), the earlier day\nmust not be earlier than the day the notice is given to the person.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nSuspension and cancellation from the Register  Part 4-6\nSuspension from the Register  Division 1\nSection 41G\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
