      "skos:note": "The earlier day must not be earlier than the day the notice is given to the person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41fp-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41FP(3) Conditions imposed after kinds of medical devices are",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 92,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of paragraphs (2)(aa) and (ab), the earlier day\nmust not be earlier than the day the notice is given to the person.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nSuspension and cancellation from the Register  Part 4-6\nSuspension from the Register  Division 1\nSection 41G\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025"
    },
