    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41GB Notice of proposed suspension must be given in certain cases",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41gb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.94",
      "values:originalText": "(1) However, before suspending a kind of medical device from the\nRegister because it is likely that there are grounds for cancelling\nthe entry of the kind of device from the Register under\nsection 41GN, the Secretary must:\n(a) inform the person by written notice that the Secretary\nproposes the suspension and set out the reasons for it; and\n(b) give the person a reasonable opportunity to make\nsubmissions to the Secretary in relation to the proposed\nsuspension.\n(2) The Secretary is not to make a decision relating to the proposed\nsuspension until the Secretary has had regard to any submissions\nthe person makes under paragraph (1)(b).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) However, before suspending a kind of medical device from the\nRegister because it is likely that there are grounds for cancelling\nthe entry of the kind of device from the Register under\nsection 41GN, the Secretary must:\n(a) inform the person by written notice that the Secretary\nproposes the suspension and set out the reasons for it; and\n(b) give the person a reasonable opportunity to make\nsubmissions to the Secretary in relation to the proposed\nsuspension.\n(2) The Secretary is not to make a decision relating to the proposed\nsuspension until the Secretary has had regard to any submissions\nthe person makes under paragraph (1)(b).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gb-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gb-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fb241c12d963742e20d357f4ce04dec330716b7567c6ffbba83f66f61e15be92"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41gb",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41GB Notice of proposed suspension must be given in certain cases",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 94,
      "values:originalText": "(1) However, before suspending a kind of medical device from the\nRegister because it is likely that there are grounds for cancelling\nthe entry of the kind of device from the Register under\nsection 41GN, the Secretary must:\n(a) inform the person by written notice that the Secretary\nproposes the suspension and set out the reasons for it; and\n(b) give the person a reasonable opportunity to make\nsubmissions to the Secretary in relation to the proposed\nsuspension.\n(2) The Secretary is not to make a decision relating to the proposed\nsuspension until the Secretary has had regard to any submissions\nthe person makes under paragraph (1)(b)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gb-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41GB(1) Notice of proposed suspension must be given in certain cases",
