      "skos:note": "Suspension under this section is limited to the same extent as suspension under Division 3 of Part 4-4. Secretary must take action before suspending a device from the Register"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41gf-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41GF(2) Suspension where conformity assessment certificate",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 97,
      "values:originalText": "(2) If the suspension under Division 3 of Part 4-4 is limited to some\nmedical devices of that kind, the suspension under this section is\ntaken to be limited to the same extent."
    },
