      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41GH(1) Revocation of suspension",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 98,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary must revoke a suspension under section 41GF if:\n(a) the suspension under Division 3 of Part 4-4 ceases to have\neffect; and\n(b) the Secretary is satisfied that there are no other grounds for\nsuspending the kind of device from the Register."
