      },
      "cml:premiseText": "There are one or more prohibitions in force for the purposes of subsection 9K(1) or (3) that are subject to conditions.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Imports, exports, manufacture, and supplies would contravene one or more of those conditions."
    },
    {
