      "cml:conclusionText": "The device would spread to other areas."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gl",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41GL Immediate cancellation of entries of kinds of medical devices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41gl"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "from the Register\nThe Secretary may, by written notice given to the person in relation\nto whom a kind of medical device is included in the Register,\ncancel the entry of the kind of device from the Register if:\n(a) the Secretary is satisfied that there would be an imminent risk\nof death, serious illness or serious injury if the kind of device\ncontinues to be included in the Register; or\n(b) devices of that kind are no longer therapeutic goods; or\n(c) devices of that kind are no longer medical devices; or\n(ca) the kind of medical device is covered by an exemption under\nparagraph 41HA(1)(b); or\n(d) the person requests in writing the cancellation of the entry of\nthe kind of device from the Register; or\n(e) the Secretary is satisfied that a statement made in or in\nconnection with:\n(i) the application for including the kind of device in the\nRegister; or\n(ii) the certification or purported certification under\nsection 41FD relating to the application;\nwas false or misleading in a material particular; or\n(f) the annual charge payable under subsection 4(1B) of the\nTherapeutic Goods (Charges) Act 1989 in respect of the\ninclusion of the kind of device in the Register is not paid\nwithin 20 working days after it becomes payable; or\n(g) the person contravenes a direction, or a condition of a\ndirection, given to the person under subsection 42DV(1) or\n42DZK(1) in relation to the advertising of the kind of device\nand the Secretary is satisfied that the contravention is\nsignificant; or\n(ga) if the person is a body corporate—a related body corporate of\nthe person contravenes a direction, or a condition of a\ndirection, given to the related body corporate under\nsubsection 42DV(1) or 42DZK(1) in relation to the\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "from the Register\nThe Secretary may, by written notice given to the person in relation\nto whom a kind of medical device is included in the Register,\ncancel the entry of the kind of device from the Register if:\n(a) the Secretary is satisfied that there would be an imminent risk\nof death, serious illness or serious injury if the kind of device\ncontinues to be included in the Register; or\n(b) devices of that kind are no longer therapeutic goods; or\n(c) devices of that kind are no longer medical devices; or\n(ca) the kind of medical device is covered by an exemption under\nparagraph 41HA(1)(b); or\n(d) the person requests in writing the cancellation of the entry of\nthe kind of device from the Register; or\n(e) the Secretary is satisfied that a statement made in or in\nconnection with:\n(i) the application for including the kind of device in the\nRegister; or\n(ii) the certification or purported certification under\nsection 41FD relating to the application;\nwas false or misleading in a material particular; or\n(f) the annual charge payable under subsection 4(1B) of the\nTherapeutic Goods (Charges) Act 1989 in respect of the\ninclusion of the kind of device in the Register is not paid\nwithin 20 working days after it becomes payable; or\n(g) the person contravenes a direction, or a condition of a\ndirection, given to the person under subsection 42DV(1) or\n42DZK(1) in relation to the advertising of the kind of device\nand the Secretary is satisfied that the contravention is\nsignificant; or\n(ga) if the person is a body corporate—a related body corporate of\nthe person contravenes a direction, or a condition of a\ndirection, given to the related body corporate under\nsubsection 42DV(1) or 42DZK(1) in relation to the\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gl-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gl-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gl-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f62153ad257d879789e6b825650e66eea86f6b11e9e471f8d23cae56d8f58dc2",
      "skos:note": "Cancellation of medical device entries from the Register"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41gl",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41GL Immediate cancellation of entries of kinds of medical devices",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 101,
      "values:originalText": "from the Register\nThe Secretary may, by written notice given to the person in relation\nto whom a kind of medical device is included in the Register,\ncancel the entry of the kind of device from the Register if:\n(a) the Secretary is satisfied that there would be an imminent risk\nof death, serious illness or serious injury if the kind of device\ncontinues to be included in the Register; or\n(b) devices of that kind are no longer therapeutic goods; or\n(c) devices of that kind are no longer medical devices; or\n(ca) the kind of medical device is covered by an exemption under\nparagraph 41HA(1)(b); or\n(d) the person requests in writing the cancellation of the entry of\nthe kind of device from the Register; or\n(e) the Secretary is satisfied that a statement made in or in\nconnection with:\n(i) the application for including the kind of device in the\nRegister; or\n(ii) the certification or purported certification under\nsection 41FD relating to the application;\nwas false or misleading in a material particular; or\n(f) the annual charge payable under subsection 4(1B) of the\nTherapeutic Goods (Charges) Act 1989 in respect of the\ninclusion of the kind of device in the Register is not paid\nwithin 20 working days after it becomes payable; or\n(g) the person contravenes a direction, or a condition of a\ndirection, given to the person under subsection 42DV(1) or\n42DZK(1) in relation to the advertising of the kind of device\nand the Secretary is satisfied that the contravention is\nsignificant; or\n(ga) if the person is a body corporate—a related body corporate of\nthe person contravenes a direction, or a condition of a\ndirection, given to the related body corporate under\nsubsection 42DV(1) or 42DZK(1) in relation to the\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices"
    },
