      },
      "cml:premiseText": "devices of that kind are no longer therapeutic goods; or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gm",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41GM Cancellation of entries of kinds of medical devices from the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41gm"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.103",
      "values:originalText": "Register after section 41JA notice\n(1) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person in relation\nto whom a kind of medical device is included in the Register,\ncancel the entry of the kind of device from the Register if:\n(a) the Secretary gives to the person a notice under section 41JA\nrequiring the person to give to the Secretary information or\ndocuments relating to the kind of device; and\n(b) the notice under section 41JA is given for the purposes of\nascertaining whether any of the certifications by the person\nunder section 41FD in relation to the kind of device are\nincorrect; and\n(c) the person fails to comply with the notice under section 41JA\nwithin a further 10 working days from the day specified in\nthat notice.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "skos:definition": "Register after section 41JA notice\n(1) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person in relation\nto whom a kind of medical device is included in the Register,\ncancel the entry of the kind of device from the Register if:\n(a) the Secretary gives to the person a notice under section 41JA\nrequiring the person to give to the Secretary information or\ndocuments relating to the kind of device; and\n(b) the notice under section 41JA is given for the purposes of\nascertaining whether any of the certifications by the person\nunder section 41FD in relation to the kind of device are\nincorrect; and\n(c) the person fails to comply with the notice under section 41JA\nwithin a further 10 working days from the day specified in\nthat notice.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gm-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gm-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gm-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gm-logic-ltl-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b9e62828abfd28c6a31138351f9d2abda0a4c1b2bda3498dcc4678ba133adba5",
      "skos:note": "Cancellation of entries from medical device register upon non-compliance with notice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41gm",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41GM Cancellation of entries of kinds of medical devices from the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 103,
      "values:originalText": "Register after section 41JA notice\n(1) The Secretary may, by written notice given to the person in relation\nto whom a kind of medical device is included in the Register,\ncancel the entry of the kind of device from the Register if:\n(a) the Secretary gives to the person a notice under section 41JA\nrequiring the person to give to the Secretary information or\ndocuments relating to the kind of device; and\n(b) the notice under section 41JA is given for the purposes of\nascertaining whether any of the certifications by the person\nunder section 41FD in relation to the kind of device are\nincorrect; and\n(c) the person fails to comply with the notice under section 41JA\nwithin a further 10 working days from the day specified in\nthat notice.\n\nChapter 4  Medical devices"
    },
    {
