    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41go",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41GO Limiting cancellation of entries from Register to some",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41go"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.106",
      "values:originalText": "medical devices of a particular kind\n(1) If the Secretary is satisfied that the ground for cancelling the entry\nof a kind of medical device from the Register applies only to some\nmedical devices of that kind, the Secretary must limit the\ncancellation to the medical devices to which that ground or any\nother ground for cancellation applies.\n(2) If the cancellation of the entry of a kind of medical device from the\nRegister is limited to some medical devices of that kind, the\nSecretary:\n(a) must vary the entry in the Register accordingly; and\n(b) must not delete the entry from the Register because of the\ncancellation.",
      "skos:definition": "medical devices of a particular kind\n(1) If the Secretary is satisfied that the ground for cancelling the entry\nof a kind of medical device from the Register applies only to some\nmedical devices of that kind, the Secretary must limit the\ncancellation to the medical devices to which that ground or any\nother ground for cancellation applies.\n(2) If the cancellation of the entry of a kind of medical device from the\nRegister is limited to some medical devices of that kind, the\nSecretary:\n(a) must vary the entry in the Register accordingly; and\n(b) must not delete the entry from the Register because of the\ncancellation.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41go-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41go-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fa990293713b01e938971b745b1613bfff5cd7af3c6785fd54ab5dee391d4aae"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41go",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41GO Limiting cancellation of entries from Register to some",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 106,
      "values:originalText": "medical devices of a particular kind\n(1) If the Secretary is satisfied that the ground for cancelling the entry\nof a kind of medical device from the Register applies only to some\nmedical devices of that kind, the Secretary must limit the\ncancellation to the medical devices to which that ground or any\nother ground for cancellation applies.\n(2) If the cancellation of the entry of a kind of medical device from the\nRegister is limited to some medical devices of that kind, the\nSecretary:\n(a) must vary the entry in the Register accordingly; and\n(b) must not delete the entry from the Register because of the\ncancellation."
    },
