      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) If the cancellation of the entry of a kind of medical device from the\nRegister is limited to some medical devices of that kind...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the Secretary:\n(a) must vary the entry in the Register accordingly;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41go-ss-2-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST NOT",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must not delete entry from Register upon cancellation of medical device",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) If the cancellation of the entry of a kind of medical device from the\nRegister is limited to some medical devices of that kind...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the Secretary:\n(b) must not delete the entry from the Register because of the\ncancellation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41go-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "SUBCLASS OF",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Not deleting entry from Register is a subclass of obligation to preserve",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) If the cancellation of the entry of a kind of medical device from the\nRegister is limited to some medical devices of that kind...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the Secretary:\n(b) must not delete the entry from the Register because of the\ncancellation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gp",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41GP Publication of cancellation of entry from Register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41gp"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.106",
      "values:originalText": "The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the\nDepartment’s website, as soon as practicable after cancelling an\nentry from the Register of a kind of medical device, or of some\ndevices of a particular kind, a notice setting out particulars of the\ncancellation.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nSuspension and cancellation from the Register  Part 4-6\nCancellation of entries from the Register  Division 2\nSection 41GQ\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "skos:definition": "The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the\nDepartment’s website, as soon as practicable after cancelling an\nentry from the Register of a kind of medical device, or of some\ndevices of a particular kind, a notice setting out particulars of the\ncancellation.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nSuspension and cancellation from the Register  Part 4-6\nCancellation of entries from the Register  Division 2\nSection 41GQ\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gp-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gp-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gp-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e584f3c5b9d0f68cb805945dc2ff98262902c3a1f2551dfcb2483000f06ee7cd",
      "skos:note": "Publish notice of cancellation from Register after cancelling medical device entry.",
      "dc:description": "Notice setting out particulars of cancellation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41gp",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41GP Publication of cancellation of entry from Register",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 106,
      "values:originalText": "The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the\nDepartment’s website, as soon as practicable after cancelling an\nentry from the Register of a kind of medical device, or of some\ndevices of a particular kind, a notice setting out particulars of the\ncancellation.\n\nMedical devices  Chapter 4\nSuspension and cancellation from the Register  Part 4-6\nCancellation of entries from the Register  Division 2\nSection 41GQ\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025"
    },
    {
