    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gu-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41GU(3) Variation or revocation of exemption",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41gu-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.111",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may, by writing:\n(a) vary the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 41GS (including by imposing new conditions); or\n(b) revoke the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 41GS.\nWhen variation or revocation takes effect",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister may, by writing:\n(a) vary the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 41GS (including by imposing new conditions); or\n(b) revoke the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 41GS.\nWhen variation or revocation takes effect",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gu"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gu-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gu-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a78195726c8076a4b1ff3191029b528c9107559d2525441f3bffbceff12a9959",
      "skos:note": "Variation or revocation of exemption conditions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41gu-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41GU(3) Variation or revocation of exemption",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 111,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may, by writing:\n(a) vary the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 41GS (including by imposing new conditions); or\n(b) revoke the conditions of an exemption made under\nsection 41GS.\nWhen variation or revocation takes effect"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41gu-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
