      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1A) An approval for use of the kind referred to in paragraph (1)(d) must not be granted to a person unless the person is a health practitioner.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Approval eligibility for special and experimental uses is diffused through the system."
    },
