      "values:originalText": "(3) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 41JA; and\n(aa) the person is covered by paragraph 41JA(1)(b), (ba), (d) or\n(da) or subsection 41JA(1E); and\n(b) the person fails to comply with the notice.\nPenalty: 500 penalty units.\nNote:\nFailure to comply with the notice might also lead to suspension or\nrevocation of a conformity assessment certificate (see Divisions 3 and\n4 of Part 4-4) or suspension or cancellation of the entry of a kind of\nmedical device in the Register (see Part 4-6).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 41JA; and\n(aa) the person is covered by paragraph 41JA(1)(b), (ba), (d) or\n(da) or subsection 41JA(1E); and\n(b) the person fails to comply with the notice.\nPenalty: 500 penalty units.\nNote:\nFailure to comply with the notice might also lead to suspension or\nrevocation of a conformity assessment certificate (see Divisions 3 and\n4 of Part 4-4) or suspension or cancellation of the entry of a kind of\nmedical device in the Register (see Part 4-6).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jb"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jb-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jb-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jb-ss-3-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jb-ss-3-logic-descriptionlogic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1be65ce8f73e1c3edc90e7157f54221deda5c3748cc47ebc244be6fb4466746c",
      "skos:note": "Failure to comply with notice leads to penalty and potential suspension/cancellation of certificates."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41jb-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41JB(3) Complying with the Secretary’s requirements",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 129,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 41JA; and\n(aa) the person is covered by paragraph 41JA(1)(b), (ba), (d) or\n(da) or subsection 41JA(1E); and\n(b) the person fails to comply with the notice.\nPenalty: 500 penalty units.\nNote:\nFailure to comply with the notice might also lead to suspension or\nrevocation of a conformity assessment certificate (see Divisions 3 and\n4 of Part 4-4) or suspension or cancellation of the entry of a kind of\nmedical device in the Register (see Part 4-6)."
    },
