    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jf-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41JF(1) Secretary may require information relating to health",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41jf-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.136",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval\nunder subsection 41HD(1), (1A) or (2) in relation to a medical\ndevice a written notice requiring the person to give to the Secretary\nspecified information or documents relating to one or more of the\nfollowing:\n(a) the supply of the medical device;\n(b) the handling of the medical device;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the medical device;\n(d) the results of the supply of the medical device;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph in relation to the kind of medical\ndevice that includes the medical device.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval\nunder subsection 41HD(1), (1A) or (2) in relation to a medical\ndevice a written notice requiring the person to give to the Secretary\nspecified information or documents relating to one or more of the\nfollowing:\n(a) the supply of the medical device;\n(b) the handling of the medical device;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the medical device;\n(d) the results of the supply of the medical device;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph in relation to the kind of medical\ndevice that includes the medical device.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jf"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jf-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jf-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jf-ss-1-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jf-ss-1-logic-deontic-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "01b1e38840e54a81d1e77e4818208cbbad983ea495eb5d4850925280a9f86e77",
      "skos:note": "Secretary may require specified information or documents from a person granted an approval. The Secretary may require information from a person granted an authority under subsection 41HC(1)",
      "dc:description": "specified information or documents"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41jf-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41JF(1) Secretary may require information relating to health",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 136,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary may give to a person who is granted an approval\nunder subsection 41HD(1), (1A) or (2) in relation to a medical\ndevice a written notice requiring the person to give to the Secretary\nspecified information or documents relating to one or more of the\nfollowing:\n(a) the supply of the medical device;\n(b) the handling of the medical device;\n(c) the monitoring of the supply of the medical device;\n(d) the results of the supply of the medical device;\n(e) any other matter prescribed by the regulations for the\npurposes of this paragraph in relation to the kind of medical\ndevice that includes the medical device."
    },
