      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.136",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The notice must specify a reasonable period within which the\nperson must comply. The period must be at least 10 working days\nstarting on the day on which the notice is given.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The notice must specify a reasonable period within which the\nperson must comply. The period must be at least 10 working days\nstarting on the day on which the notice is given.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jf"
