    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jg",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41JG Criminal offences for failing to give information or documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41jg"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.138",
      "values:originalText": "sought under this Division\n(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 41JCA, 41JD,\n41JE, 41JF or 41JFA; and\n(b) the person fails to comply with the notice.\nPenalty: 400 penalty units.\n(2) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 41JCA, 41JD,\n41JE, 41JF or 41JFA; and\n(b) the person fails to comply with the notice.\nPenalty: 100 penalty units.\n(3) An offence against subsection (2) is an offence of strict liability.",
      "skos:definition": "sought under this Division\n(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 41JCA, 41JD,\n41JE, 41JF or 41JFA; and\n(b) the person fails to comply with the notice.\nPenalty: 400 penalty units.\n(2) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 41JCA, 41JD,\n41JE, 41JF or 41JFA; and\n(b) the person fails to comply with the notice.\nPenalty: 100 penalty units.\n(3) An offence against subsection (2) is an offence of strict liability.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jg-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jg-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jg-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "087abf06b670b386b28e788d0cd6864ef844ac51e5b8306ab616d2838b0eef0b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41jg",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41JG Criminal offences for failing to give information or documents",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 138,
      "values:originalText": "sought under this Division\n(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 41JCA, 41JD,\n41JE, 41JF or 41JFA; and\n(b) the person fails to comply with the notice.\nPenalty: 400 penalty units.\n(2) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 41JCA, 41JD,\n41JE, 41JF or 41JFA; and\n(b) the person fails to comply with the notice.\nPenalty: 100 penalty units.\n(3) An offence against subsection (2) is an offence of strict liability."
    },
