      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsection (1) or (2) does not apply as a result of\nsubparagraph (1)(b)(ii) or (2)(b)(ii) if the information did not omit\nany matter or thing without which the information is misleading in\na material particular.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (5): see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Subsection (1) or (2) does not apply as a result of\nsubparagraph (1)(b)(ii) or (2)(b)(ii) if the information did not omit\nany matter or thing without which the information is misleading in\na material particular.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (5): see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jh"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jh-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jh-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d166ef5ab101cd5b5d1ee63a1fa45e3198f7c8474cc4328fa9aa4e3b9e295e09",
      "skos:note": "Defendant bears evidential burden for information not omitting material particulars."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41jh-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41JH(5) False or misleading information",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 138,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subsection (1) or (2) does not apply as a result of\nsubparagraph (1)(b)(ii) or (2)(b)(ii) if the information did not omit\nany matter or thing without which the information is misleading in\na material particular.\nNote:\nA defendant bears an evidential burden in relation to the matter in\nsubsection (5): see subsection 13.3(3) of the Criminal Code."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jh-ss-5-norm",
