      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.143",
      "values:originalText": "(4) This subsection applies to a healthcare facility if:\n(a) a health practitioner provides treatment to a person in the\nfacility for a serious deterioration in the health of the person;\nand\n(b) the use of a reportable medical device has resulted in the\nserious deterioration in the health of the person.\nReport requirements",
      "skos:definition": "(4) This subsection applies to a healthcare facility if:\n(a) a health practitioner provides treatment to a person in the\nfacility for a serious deterioration in the health of the person;\nand\n(b) the use of a reportable medical device has resulted in the\nserious deterioration in the health of the person.\nReport requirements",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41jm"
      },
