      "values:originalText": "Imposition of a requirement under section 41KA does not affect\nthe Secretary’s powers to:\n(a) suspend the entry of a kind of medical device, or some\nmedical devices of a particular kind, from the Register under",
      "skos:definition": "Imposition of a requirement under section 41KA does not affect\nthe Secretary’s powers to:\n(a) suspend the entry of a kind of medical device, or some\nmedical devices of a particular kind, from the Register under",
