      "skos:note": "Payment of assessment fee by instalments is obligatory."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41lc-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41LC(1) Payment of assessment fee by instalments",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 152,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The regulations may provide for the payment of an assessment fee\nto be made by such instalments and at such times as are ascertained\nin accordance with the regulations, and the assessment fee is due\nand payable accordingly."
    },
