    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41mg",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41MG Exceptions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41mg"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.170",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 41ME, 41MEA and 41MF do not apply to the extent that:\n(a) the quality management systems applied to the medical\ndevice comply with one or more conformity assessment\nstandards that apply to them; and\n(b) the conformity assessment procedures have not been applied\nto the device only in respect of a part or parts of the\nconformity assessment procedures to which one or more of\nthose conformity assessment standards relate.\nNote:\nConformity assessment standards are determined under Division 2 of",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Sections 41ME, 41MEA and 41MF do not apply to the extent that:\n(a) the quality management systems applied to the medical\ndevice comply with one or more conformity assessment\nstandards that apply to them; and\n(b) the conformity assessment procedures have not been applied\nto the device only in respect of a part or parts of the\nconformity assessment procedures to which one or more of\nthose conformity assessment standards relate.\nNote:\nConformity assessment standards are determined under Division 2 of",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41mg-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "693b1de23cd9dc3f6bbd1467d101a2055fc005876d2cdd6979058cdf5abacdc4",
      "skos:note": "Exceptions for certain conformity assessment standards"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41mg",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41MG Exceptions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 170,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Sections 41ME, 41MEA and 41MF do not apply to the extent that:\n(a) the quality management systems applied to the medical\ndevice comply with one or more conformity assessment\nstandards that apply to them; and\n(b) the conformity assessment procedures have not been applied\nto the device only in respect of a part or parts of the\nconformity assessment procedures to which one or more of\nthose conformity assessment standards relate.\nNote:\nConformity assessment standards are determined under Division 2 of"
    },
