      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(d) either: (i) the use of the medical device for the advertised purpose has resulted in, will result in, or is likely to result in, harm or injury to any person;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "False advertising about medical devices is prohibited if it results in harm or injury."
    },
    {
