      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person, by any means, advertises a medical device as\nbeing for a purpose; and\n(b) the device is of a kind included in the Register; and\n(c) the purpose is not a purpose accepted in relation to that\ninclusion.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(The advertising must recur over time.)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ml-ss-3-logic-diffusion-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Diffusion",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Requires diffusion of information about medical device registration.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person, by any means, advertises a medical device as\nbeing for a purpose; and\n(b) the device is of a kind included in the Register; and\n(c) the purpose is not a purpose accepted in relation to that\ninclusion.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(The information must be diffused widely.)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ml-ss-3-logic-argumentation-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
