      "cml:integrityHash": "6d4d12d52e5621572383f4dc6e340efd3859ebfa805cf59391df015458a34dda",
      "skos:note": "Committing an offence if a medical device is included in the Register and an act or omission breaches a condition of its inclusion."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41mn-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41MN(4) Criminal offences relating to breaches of conditions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 181,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) a kind of medical device is included in the Register in\nrelation to the person; and\n(b) the person does an act or omits to do an act; and\n(c) the act or omission breaches a condition of the inclusion of\nthe kind of device in the Register.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth."
    },
