      "cml:premiseText": "(a) the presentation of goods includes matters in relation to...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Goods must meet specific presentation requirements to be considered vaping goods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41p-ss-2-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Misleading or confusing presentation is prohibited",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(i) is capable of being misleading or confusing as to the content or proper use or identification of the goods;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Goods cannot be presented in a way that is misleading or confusing."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41p-ss-2-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Minister's discretion for determining vaping goods",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Minister may determine that goods are or are not vaping goods etc.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Minister has the authority to determine whether goods are vaping goods or not."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41p-ss-2-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition on presenting false information",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(ii) suggests that the goods have ingredients, components or characteristics that they do not have.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Goods cannot be presented as having ingredients or characteristics they do not actually have."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41p-ss-2-logic-deontic-6",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Right to determine vaping goods",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) goods are taken to be presented as being a particular kind of goods even if...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Minister has the right to determine whether goods are vaping goods or not."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41p-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41P(3) Meaning of vaping goods and related terms",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41p-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, for the\npurposes of this Act, specified goods or specified classes of goods:\n(a) are or are not vaping goods; or\n(b) when used, advertised, or presented for use or supply in a\nparticular way, are or are not vaping goods.\n\nChapter 4A  Vaping goods",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, for the\npurposes of this Act, specified goods or specified classes of goods:\n(a) are or are not vaping goods; or\n(b) when used, advertised, or presented for use or supply in a\nparticular way, are or are not vaping goods.\n\nChapter 4A  Vaping goods",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41p"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41p-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41p-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2bf494815ec92fd402a9bee16be0c21341c729bb155eb3c4c4f16ae8ae609b5a",
      "skos:note": "Authority to determine vaping goods classification"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41p-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41P(3) Meaning of vaping goods and related terms",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 202,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, for the\npurposes of this Act, specified goods or specified classes of goods:\n(a) are or are not vaping goods; or\n(b) when used, advertised, or presented for use or supply in a\nparticular way, are or are not vaping goods.\n\nChapter 4A  Vaping goods"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41p-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41p-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
