      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.204",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A person who contravenes subsection (3) commits a separate\ncontravention of that subsection in respect of each unit of vaping\ngoods imported by the person into Australia.\nNote:\nFor unit of vaping goods, see subsection 3(1).\n\nVaping goods  Chapter 4A\nOffences and civil penalty provisions relating to vaping goods  Part 4A-2\nGeneral  Division 1\nSection 41QA\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nException",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A person who contravenes subsection (3) commits a separate\ncontravention of that subsection in respect of each unit of vaping\ngoods imported by the person into Australia.\nNote:\nFor unit of vaping goods, see subsection 3(1).\n\nVaping goods  Chapter 4A\nOffences and civil penalty provisions relating to vaping goods  Part 4A-2\nGeneral  Division 1\nSection 41QA\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nException",
