      "values:originalText": "(3) A person contravenes this subsection if the person supplies vaping\ngoods in Australia.\nMaximum civil penalty:\n(a) for an individual—7,000 penalty units; and\n(b) for a body corporate—70,000 penalty units.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A person contravenes this subsection if the person supplies vaping\ngoods in Australia.\nMaximum civil penalty:\n(a) for an individual—7,000 penalty units; and\n(b) for a body corporate—70,000 penalty units.",
      "values:partOf": {
