      "skos:note": "Supplying vaping goods in Australia is prohibited."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41qb-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41QB(3) Offences and civil penalty provision—supplying vaping goods",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 206,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A person contravenes this subsection if the person supplies vaping\ngoods in Australia.\nMaximum civil penalty:\n(a) for an individual—7,000 penalty units; and\n(b) for a body corporate—70,000 penalty units."
    },
    {
