    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41qc",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41QC Offences and civil penalty provision—possessing at least",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41qc"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.211",
      "values:originalText": "commercial quantity of vaping goods\nOffences—possessing at least commercial quantity but less than\n100 times commercial quantity\n(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person possesses a quantity of a kind of vaping goods in\nAustralia; and\n(b) the quantity is at least the commercial quantity, but less than\n100 times the commercial quantity, of that kind of vaping\ngoods.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years or 1,000 penalty units, or both.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA.\n(2) Absolute liability applies to paragraph (1)(b).\n(3) A person commits an offence of strict liability if:\n(a) the person possesses a quantity of a kind of vaping goods in\nAustralia; and\n(b) the quantity is at least the commercial quantity, but less than\n100 times the commercial quantity, of that kind of vaping\ngoods.\nPenalty: 120 penalty units.\n\nChapter 4A  Vaping goods",
      "skos:definition": "commercial quantity of vaping goods\nOffences—possessing at least commercial quantity but less than\n100 times commercial quantity\n(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person possesses a quantity of a kind of vaping goods in\nAustralia; and\n(b) the quantity is at least the commercial quantity, but less than\n100 times the commercial quantity, of that kind of vaping\ngoods.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years or 1,000 penalty units, or both.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA.\n(2) Absolute liability applies to paragraph (1)(b).\n(3) A person commits an offence of strict liability if:\n(a) the person possesses a quantity of a kind of vaping goods in\nAustralia; and\n(b) the quantity is at least the commercial quantity, but less than\n100 times the commercial quantity, of that kind of vaping\ngoods.\nPenalty: 120 penalty units.\n\nChapter 4A  Vaping goods",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41qc-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41qc-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41qc-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a085195ac64144deba2ae46a376746eea46dde7ab95499250d752ce535de453c"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41qc",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41QC Offences and civil penalty provision—possessing at least",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 211,
      "values:originalText": "commercial quantity of vaping goods\nOffences—possessing at least commercial quantity but less than\n100 times commercial quantity\n(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person possesses a quantity of a kind of vaping goods in\nAustralia; and\n(b) the quantity is at least the commercial quantity, but less than\n100 times the commercial quantity, of that kind of vaping\ngoods.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years or 1,000 penalty units, or both.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA.\n(2) Absolute liability applies to paragraph (1)(b).\n(3) A person commits an offence of strict liability if:\n(a) the person possesses a quantity of a kind of vaping goods in\nAustralia; and\n(b) the quantity is at least the commercial quantity, but less than\n100 times the commercial quantity, of that kind of vaping\ngoods.\nPenalty: 120 penalty units.\n\nChapter 4A  Vaping goods"
    },
