    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41qc-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41QC(1) Offences and civil penalty provision—possessing at least",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 211,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person possesses a quantity of a kind of vaping goods in\nAustralia; and\n(b) the quantity is at least the commercial quantity, but less than\n100 times the commercial quantity, of that kind of vaping\ngoods.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years or 1,000 penalty units, or both.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41qc-ss-1-norm",
