      "values:originalText": "(3) A person commits an offence of strict liability if:\n(a) the person possesses a quantity of a kind of vaping goods in\nAustralia; and\n(b) the quantity is at least the commercial quantity, but less than\n100 times the commercial quantity, of that kind of vaping\ngoods.\nPenalty: 120 penalty units.\n\nChapter 4A  Vaping goods",
