    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41r",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41R Minister may determine that specified vaping goods may be",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41r"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.221",
      "values:originalText": "supplied or possessed in Australia in specified\ncircumstances etc.\nThe Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that\nspecified vaping goods, or a specified class of vaping goods, may\nbe supplied or possessed in Australia:\n(a) by a specified person, or a specified class of persons; and\n(b) in the circumstances (if any) specified in the determination;\nand\n(c) subject to the conditions (if any) specified in the\ndetermination.\nNote:\nConditions may, for example, relate to the value or amount of\nspecified vaping goods or the manner in which specified vaping goods\nmay be supplied.",
      "skos:definition": "supplied or possessed in Australia in specified\ncircumstances etc.\nThe Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that\nspecified vaping goods, or a specified class of vaping goods, may\nbe supplied or possessed in Australia:\n(a) by a specified person, or a specified class of persons; and\n(b) in the circumstances (if any) specified in the determination;\nand\n(c) subject to the conditions (if any) specified in the\ndetermination.\nNote:\nConditions may, for example, relate to the value or amount of\nspecified vaping goods or the manner in which specified vaping goods\nmay be supplied.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41r-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41r-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41r-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "562b9ab2a5e6dd96a9693eeffc31c484fddb954b15b8cc9826d7e29d2f40cc82",
      "skos:note": "The Minister may determine that specified vaping goods may be supplied or possessed in Australia under certain circumstances."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41r",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41R Minister may determine that specified vaping goods may be",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 221,
      "values:originalText": "supplied or possessed in Australia in specified\ncircumstances etc.\nThe Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that\nspecified vaping goods, or a specified class of vaping goods, may\nbe supplied or possessed in Australia:\n(a) by a specified person, or a specified class of persons; and\n(b) in the circumstances (if any) specified in the determination;\nand\n(c) subject to the conditions (if any) specified in the\ndetermination.\nNote:\nConditions may, for example, relate to the value or amount of\nspecified vaping goods or the manner in which specified vaping goods\nmay be supplied."
    },
