    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ra",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41RA Minister may determine other indications for which vaping",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ra"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.221",
      "values:originalText": "goods may be used\nThe Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine, for the\npurposes of paragraph 41QB(11)(a), indications (other than\nsmoking cessation or management of nicotine dependence) for\nwhich vaping goods may be used.\n\nChapter 4A  Vaping goods",
      "skos:definition": "goods may be used\nThe Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine, for the\npurposes of paragraph 41QB(11)(a), indications (other than\nsmoking cessation or management of nicotine dependence) for\nwhich vaping goods may be used.\n\nChapter 4A  Vaping goods",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ra-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41ra-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a9bdc539554b1abf868dc255211eb1bc1015485d0e9f969726951d74b345eff1",
      "skos:note": "Minister may determine indications for vaping goods use"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41ra",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41RA Minister may determine other indications for which vaping",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 221,
      "values:originalText": "goods may be used\nThe Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine, for the\npurposes of paragraph 41QB(11)(a), indications (other than\nsmoking cessation or management of nicotine dependence) for\nwhich vaping goods may be used.\n\nChapter 4A  Vaping goods"
    },
