    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rb",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "41RB Application to Secretary for consent to manufacture, supply",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41rb"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.222",
      "values:originalText": "or possess vaping goods\n(1) A person may apply to the Secretary for consent to manufacture,\nsupply or possess vaping goods.\n(2) An application under subsection (1) must be in accordance with a\nform approved by the Secretary and be accompanied by the fee (if\nany) prescribed by the regulations.\nFurther information\n(3) The Secretary may, by notice in writing given to the applicant,\nrequire the applicant to give to the Secretary, within such\nreasonable time as is specified in the notice, such further\ninformation concerning the application as is specified in the notice.\nApplications or information may be given electronically\n(4) An approval of a form referred to in subsection (2), or a notice\nreferred to in subsection (3), may require or permit an application\nor information to be given in accordance with specified software\nrequirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.",
      "skos:definition": "or possess vaping goods\n(1) A person may apply to the Secretary for consent to manufacture,\nsupply or possess vaping goods.\n(2) An application under subsection (1) must be in accordance with a\nform approved by the Secretary and be accompanied by the fee (if\nany) prescribed by the regulations.\nFurther information\n(3) The Secretary may, by notice in writing given to the applicant,\nrequire the applicant to give to the Secretary, within such\nreasonable time as is specified in the notice, such further\ninformation concerning the application as is specified in the notice.\nApplications or information may be given electronically\n(4) An approval of a form referred to in subsection (2), or a notice\nreferred to in subsection (3), may require or permit an application\nor information to be given in accordance with specified software\nrequirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rb-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rb-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rb-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-41rb-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b869976e0d2ce9cee906734fba6320f6bb5c89de188e2a8fdbaae7f7aee121c1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-41rb",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "41RB Application to Secretary for consent to manufacture, supply",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 222,
      "values:originalText": "or possess vaping goods\n(1) A person may apply to the Secretary for consent to manufacture,\nsupply or possess vaping goods.\n(2) An application under subsection (1) must be in accordance with a\nform approved by the Secretary and be accompanied by the fee (if\nany) prescribed by the regulations.\nFurther information\n(3) The Secretary may, by notice in writing given to the applicant,\nrequire the applicant to give to the Secretary, within such\nreasonable time as is specified in the notice, such further\ninformation concerning the application as is specified in the notice.\nApplications or information may be given electronically\n(4) An approval of a form referred to in subsection (2), or a notice\nreferred to in subsection (3), may require or permit an application\nor information to be given in accordance with specified software\nrequirements:\n(a) on a specified kind of data processing device; or\n(b) by way of a specified kind of electronic transmission."
    },
