      "values:originalText": "(6) As soon as practicable after giving a permission under this section,\nthe Secretary must cause the permission to be published on the\nDepartment’s website.\n\nAdvertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering  Chapter 5\nAdvertising and generic information  Part 5-1\nAdvertising offences and civil penalties  Division 3A\nSection 42DKB\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
