    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-42dw-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42DW(3) Offences—contravening direction under section 42DV",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 252,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the Secretary has given a direction to the person under\nsubsection 42DV(1) or (2); and\n(b) the person does an act or omits to do an act; and\n(c) the act or omission contravenes the direction or a condition\nof the direction.\nPenalty: 100 penalty units."
