      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42e-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits dealing with counterfeit therapeutic goods.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Goods are counterfeit if any of the following contain a false representation...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Dealing with counterfeit therapeutic goods is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42e-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Temporal Interval",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Defines a temporal interval for when goods are considered counterfeit.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Goods are counterfeit if any of the following contain a false representation...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Goods are counterfeit from the time they contain a false representation until they are no longer counterfeit."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42e-ss-2-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Recurring Trace",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Defines a recurring trace for goods that are considered counterfeit.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Goods are counterfeit if any of the following contain a false representation...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Goods that are counterfeit have a recurring trace from the time they contain a false representation until they are no longer counterfeit."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42e-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Diffuse",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Diffuses information about counterfeit goods.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Goods are counterfeit if any of the following contain a false representation...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Information about counterfeit goods should be diffused to prevent their sale and distribution."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42e-ss-2-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Recognize",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Aids in recognizing counterfeit goods.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Goods are counterfeit if any of the following contain a false representation...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A system should recognize goods that contain a false representation as counterfeit."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42e-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42E(3) Offence of dealing with counterfeit therapeutic goods",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-42e-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.270",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The matters are as follows:\n(a) the identity or name of the goods;\n(b) the formulation, composition or design specification of the\ngoods or of any ingredient or component of them;\n(c) the presence or absence of any ingredient or component of\nthe goods;\n(d) the strength or size of the goods (other than the size of any\npack in which the goods are contained);\n\nAdvertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering  Chapter 5\nCounterfeit therapeutic goods  Part 5-2\n\nSection 42EA\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(e) the strength or size of any ingredient or component of the\ngoods;\n(f) the sponsor, source, manufacturer or place of manufacture of\nthe goods.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The matters are as follows:\n(a) the identity or name of the goods;\n(b) the formulation, composition or design specification of the\ngoods or of any ingredient or component of them;\n(c) the presence or absence of any ingredient or component of\nthe goods;\n(d) the strength or size of the goods (other than the size of any\npack in which the goods are contained);\n\nAdvertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering  Chapter 5\nCounterfeit therapeutic goods  Part 5-2\n\nSection 42EA\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(e) the strength or size of any ingredient or component of the\ngoods;\n(f) the sponsor, source, manufacturer or place of manufacture of\nthe goods.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42e-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42e-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "38c7cd252153cbf595d66ad21b34fe0b616da4cbab14869ada91d8c3f86ef7fb",
      "skos:note": "Offence of dealing with counterfeit therapeutic goods"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-42e-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42E(3) Offence of dealing with counterfeit therapeutic goods",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 270,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The matters are as follows:\n(a) the identity or name of the goods;\n(b) the formulation, composition or design specification of the\ngoods or of any ingredient or component of them;\n(c) the presence or absence of any ingredient or component of\nthe goods;\n(d) the strength or size of the goods (other than the size of any\npack in which the goods are contained);\n\nAdvertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering  Chapter 5\nCounterfeit therapeutic goods  Part 5-2\n\nSection 42EA\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(e) the strength or size of any ingredient or component of the\ngoods;\n(f) the sponsor, source, manufacturer or place of manufacture of\nthe goods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42e-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
