      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.276",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary may, in writing, impose requirements under this\nsection on a person if:\n(a) the person supplies or has supplied therapeutic goods of a\nparticular kind, or a particular batch of therapeutic goods of\nthat kind; and\n(b) the Secretary is satisfied that therapeutic goods of that kind,\nor included in that batch, are, have been or could possibly be,\nsubject to actual or potential tampering.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Secretary may, in writing, impose requirements under this\nsection on a person if:\n(a) the person supplies or has supplied therapeutic goods of a\nparticular kind, or a particular batch of therapeutic goods of\nthat kind; and\n(b) the Secretary is satisfied that therapeutic goods of that kind,\nor included in that batch, are, have been or could possibly be,\nsubject to actual or potential tampering.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42v"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42v-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42v-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "df8dc8357d3eb4138ef50b1634e851e3fc22c600491cc75a0e103b5e121129d9",
      "skos:note": "Secretary may impose requirements on a person supplying therapeutic goods"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-42v-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42V(1) Recall of therapeutic goods because of actual or potential",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 276,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary may, in writing, impose requirements under this\nsection on a person if:\n(a) the person supplies or has supplied therapeutic goods of a\nparticular kind, or a particular batch of therapeutic goods of\nthat kind; and\n(b) the Secretary is satisfied that therapeutic goods of that kind,\nor included in that batch, are, have been or could possibly be,\nsubject to actual or potential tampering."
    },
