    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42v-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42V(2) Recall of therapeutic goods because of actual or potential",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-42v-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.276",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The requirements may be one or more of the following:\n(a) to take specified steps, in the specified manner and within\nsuch reasonable period as is specified, to recall therapeutic\ngoods of that kind, or included in that batch, that the person\nhas supplied;\n(b) to inform the public or a specified class of persons, in the\nspecified manner and within such reasonable period as is\nspecified, that therapeutic goods of that kind, or included in\nthat batch, are, or have been, subject to actual or potential\ntampering;\n(c) to inform the public or a specified class of persons, in the\nspecified manner and within such reasonable period as is\nspecified, that therapeutic goods of that kind, or included in\nthat batch, could possibly be subject to actual or potential\ntampering.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The requirements may be one or more of the following:\n(a) to take specified steps, in the specified manner and within\nsuch reasonable period as is specified, to recall therapeutic\ngoods of that kind, or included in that batch, that the person\nhas supplied;\n(b) to inform the public or a specified class of persons, in the\nspecified manner and within such reasonable period as is\nspecified, that therapeutic goods of that kind, or included in\nthat batch, are, or have been, subject to actual or potential\ntampering;\n(c) to inform the public or a specified class of persons, in the\nspecified manner and within such reasonable period as is\nspecified, that therapeutic goods of that kind, or included in\nthat batch, could possibly be subject to actual or potential\ntampering.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42v"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42v-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42v-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42v-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "836ec64714cd89aec5a752e4368b47ee52a9a7f17cee8901a228e3a391d6418f",
      "skos:note": "Recall of therapeutic goods because of actual or potential tampering",
      "dc:description": "specified steps, in the specified manner and within a reasonable period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-42v-ss-2",
