      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.276",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Requirements referred to in paragraph (2)(a) do not apply to\ntherapeutic goods that cannot be recalled because they have been\nadministered to, or applied in the treatment of, a person.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Requirements referred to in paragraph (2)(a) do not apply to\ntherapeutic goods that cannot be recalled because they have been\nadministered to, or applied in the treatment of, a person.",
