      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.276",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the\nDepartment’s website, as soon as practicable after imposing such\nrequirements, a notice setting out particulars of the requirements.\n\nAdvertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering  Chapter 5\nProduct tampering  Part 5-3\n\nSection 42V\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Secretary must cause to be published in the Gazette or on the\nDepartment’s website, as soon as practicable after imposing such\nrequirements, a notice setting out particulars of the requirements.\n\nAdvertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering  Chapter 5\nProduct tampering  Part 5-3\n\nSection 42V\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "values:partOf": {
