      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.276",
      "values:originalText": "(6E) An offence against subsection (6D) is an offence of strict liability.\n\nChapter 5  Advertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering",
      "skos:definition": "(6E) An offence against subsection (6D) is an offence of strict liability.\n\nChapter 5  Advertising, counterfeit therapeutic goods and product tampering",
