    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-42vb-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42VB(4) Relief from liability for contraventions relating to the recall of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 278,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of subsection (2) as applying for the purposes of a\ncase tried by a judge with a jury:\n(a) a reference in that subsection to the Court is a reference to\nthe judge; and\n(b) the relief that may be granted includes withdrawing the case\nin whole or in part from the jury and directing judgment to be\nentered for the person on such terms as to costs as the judge\nthinks appropriate."
    },
    {
