      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.281",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Within 6 years of a person (the wrongdoer) contravening a civil\npenalty provision, the Secretary may apply on behalf of the\nCommonwealth to the Federal Court for an order that the\nwrongdoer pay the Commonwealth a pecuniary penalty.\nCourt may order wrongdoer to pay pecuniary penalty",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Within 6 years of a person (the wrongdoer) contravening a civil\npenalty provision, the Secretary may apply on behalf of the\nCommonwealth to the Federal Court for an order that the\nwrongdoer pay the Commonwealth a pecuniary penalty.\nCourt may order wrongdoer to pay pecuniary penalty",
      "values:partOf": {
