    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42ye",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42YE Gathering information for application for pecuniary penalty",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-42ye"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.283",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if it appears to the Secretary that a person (the\nwrongdoer) may have contravened a civil penalty provision.\n(2) If the Secretary, on reasonable grounds, suspects that a person\nother than the wrongdoer can give information relevant to an\napplication for a civil penalty order in relation to the contravention,\nwhether or not such an application has been made, the Secretary\nmay, by writing given to the person, require the person to give all\nreasonable assistance in connection with such an application.\n\nChapter 5A  Enforcement",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if it appears to the Secretary that a person (the\nwrongdoer) may have contravened a civil penalty provision.\n(2) If the Secretary, on reasonable grounds, suspects that a person\nother than the wrongdoer can give information relevant to an\napplication for a civil penalty order in relation to the contravention,\nwhether or not such an application has been made, the Secretary\nmay, by writing given to the person, require the person to give all\nreasonable assistance in connection with such an application.\n\nChapter 5A  Enforcement",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42ye-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-42ye-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f4ae9bf425f7520ea12d0f6eb728f57c43dd05446924ece3381b823755343912"
    },
    {
