      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.297",
      "values:originalText": "The Federal Court or Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 2) may discharge or vary an injunction granted by that\ncourt under this Part.",
      "skos:definition": "The Federal Court or Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia\n(Division 2) may discharge or vary an injunction granted by that\ncourt under this Part.",
