      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.302",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The regulations may require applications for exemptions to be\naccompanied by a specified fee. A fee must not be such as to\namount to taxation.\nStatements prepared by approved persons",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The regulations may require applications for exemptions to be\naccompanied by a specified fee. A fee must not be such as to\namount to taxation.\nStatements prepared by approved persons",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-44a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
