          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-44a-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-44a-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "efb5ba3b10a6802068182a388246bc2da61c6c053e88a8035a9ab02bc3f8c5aa",
      "skos:note": "Person must provide statement upon exemption application or grant",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-44a-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "44A(3) Exemptions from liability to pay charges",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 302,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The regulations may require a person who is applying for an\nexemption, or who has been granted an exemption, to provide a\nstatement:\n(a) that is prepared by an approved person; and\n(b) that specifies whether the person’s turnover of the therapeutic\ngoods concerned for the financial year concerned is of low\nvalue.\nAdditional information"
    },
