    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-45ad",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45AD Offences and civil penalty for giving false or misleading",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-45ad"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.309",
      "values:originalText": "information or documents\nFault-based offence\n(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 45AB; and\n(b) the person gives information, or produces a document, in\ncompliance or purported compliance with the notice; and\n(c) the information or document is false or misleading in a\nmaterial particular.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.\nStrict liability offence\n(2) A person commits an offence of strict liability if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 45AB; and\n\nChapter 6  Administration",
      "skos:definition": "information or documents\nFault-based offence\n(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 45AB; and\n(b) the person gives information, or produces a document, in\ncompliance or purported compliance with the notice; and\n(c) the information or document is false or misleading in a\nmaterial particular.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.\nStrict liability offence\n(2) A person commits an offence of strict liability if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 45AB; and\n\nChapter 6  Administration",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-45ad-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-45ad-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f5767a571ed19141fcbf23f1a81e758594ff2b79cb0b2ea8bfcb5cbe9a997e12"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-45ad",
