      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.309",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 45AB; and\n(b) the person gives information, or produces a document, in\ncompliance or purported compliance with the notice; and\n(c) the information or document is false or misleading in a\nmaterial particular.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.\nStrict liability offence",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 45AB; and\n(b) the person gives information, or produces a document, in\ncompliance or purported compliance with the notice; and\n(c) the information or document is false or misleading in a\nmaterial particular.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.\nStrict liability offence",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-45ad"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-45ad-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-45ad-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-45ad-ss-1-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-45ad-ss-1-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-45ad-ss-1-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "943cd4af5ec88267bc4287ac5d028002ca448f7dc6bc0c156c4b069ea215f725",
      "skos:note": "Giving false or misleading information in response to a notice is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-45ad-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45AD(1) Offences and civil penalty for giving false or misleading",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 309,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person commits an offence if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 45AB; and\n(b) the person gives information, or produces a document, in\ncompliance or purported compliance with the notice; and\n(c) the information or document is false or misleading in a\nmaterial particular.\nNote:\nFor the liability of an executive officer of a body corporate, see\nsections 54B and 54BA.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months or 1,000 penalty units, or\nboth.\nStrict liability offence"
    },
