      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 309,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A person commits an offence of strict liability if:\n(a) the person is given a notice under section 45AB; and\n\nChapter 6  Administration"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-45ad-ss-2-norm",
