      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.312",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Until a certified copy is supplied, the Secretary must provide the\nperson otherwise entitled to possession of the document, or a\nperson authorised by that person, reasonable access to the\ndocument for the purposes of inspecting and making copies of the\nwhole or a part of the document.\n\nAdministration  Chapter 6\nEntry, searches and warrants  Part 6-2\n\nSection 45A\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Until a certified copy is supplied, the Secretary must provide the\nperson otherwise entitled to possession of the document, or a\nperson authorised by that person, reasonable access to the\ndocument for the purposes of inspecting and making copies of the\nwhole or a part of the document.\n\nAdministration  Chapter 6\nEntry, searches and warrants  Part 6-2\n\nSection 45A\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "values:partOf": {
