      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.314",
      "values:originalText": "(3) An authorised person is not entitled to exercise any powers under\nsubsection (1) in relation to premises if:\n(a) the occupier of the premises has required the authorised\nperson to produce his or her identity card for inspection by\nthe occupier; and\n(b) the authorised person fails to comply with the requirement.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) An authorised person is not entitled to exercise any powers under\nsubsection (1) in relation to premises if:\n(a) the occupier of the premises has required the authorised\nperson to produce his or her identity card for inspection by\nthe occupier; and\n(b) the authorised person fails to comply with the requirement.",
      "values:partOf": {
