      "cml:premiseText": "(2) An authorised person must not, under subsection (1), enter\npremises that are a residence unless:\n(a) the occupier of the premises has consented to the entry; or\n(b) the premises are used for commercial purposes in relation to\ntherapeutic goods or vaping goods, in addition to residential\npurposes.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(2) An authorised person must not enter premises that are a residence unless:\n(a) the occupier of the premises has consented to the entry; or\n(b) the premises are used for commercial purposes in relation to\ntherapeutic goods or vaping goods, in addition to residential\npurposes."
    },
    {
