      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) Subject to subsections (2) and (3), if an authorised person has\nreasonable grounds for suspecting that there may be evidential\nmaterial in respect of an offence against this Act, in respect of a\ncontravention of a civil penalty provision or in respect of both on\nany premises",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Overlaps with time intervals for entering premises."
    },
    {
