      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.318",
      "values:originalText": "(4) It is a reasonable excuse for a person to refuse or fail to answer a\nquestion or produce a document if answering the question, or\nproducing the document, would tend to incriminate the person.\n\nChapter 6  Administration",
      "skos:definition": "(4) It is a reasonable excuse for a person to refuse or fail to answer a\nquestion or produce a document if answering the question, or\nproducing the document, would tend to incriminate the person.\n\nChapter 6  Administration",
