        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.324",
      "values:originalText": "(3) An authorised person may seize equipment under paragraph (2)(a)\nonly if:\n(a) it is not practicable to put the material in documentary form\nas mentioned in paragraph (2)(b) or to transfer the material as\nmentioned in paragraph (2)(c); or\n(b) possession by the occupier of the equipment could constitute\nan offence.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) An authorised person may seize equipment under paragraph (2)(a)\nonly if:\n(a) it is not practicable to put the material in documentary form\nas mentioned in paragraph (2)(b) or to transfer the material as\nmentioned in paragraph (2)(c); or\n(b) possession by the occupier of the equipment could constitute\nan offence.",
      "values:partOf": {
