      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.324",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The authorised person must give notice to the occupier of the\npremises of his or her intention to secure equipment and of the fact\nthat the equipment may be secured for up to 24 hours.\n\nChapter 6  Administration",
