      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.334",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A power conferred on an issuing officer by this Part is conferred on\nthe issuing officer:\n(a) in a personal capacity; and\n\nAdministration  Chapter 6\nEntry, searches and warrants  Part 6-2\n\nSection 52\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(b) not as a court, or as a member or an officer of a court.\nPowers need not be accepted",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A power conferred on an issuing officer by this Part is conferred on\nthe issuing officer:\n(a) in a personal capacity; and\n\nAdministration  Chapter 6\nEntry, searches and warrants  Part 6-2\n\nSection 52\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(b) not as a court, or as a member or an officer of a court.\nPowers need not be accepted",
      "values:partOf": {
