      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.335",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Secretary is to ensure that each authorised person is issued\nwith an identity card that incorporates a recent photograph of the\nperson.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Secretary is to ensure that each authorised person is issued\nwith an identity card that incorporates a recent photograph of the\nperson.",
      "values:partOf": {
