      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to this Act and the regulations, the Secretary may:\n(a) amend the current Poisons Standard; or\n(b) prepare a document (including schedules containing the\nnames or descriptions of substances or classes of substances),\nin substitution for the current Poisons Standard.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subject to this Act and the regulations, the Secretary may:\n(a) amend the current Poisons Standard; or\n(b) prepare a document (including schedules containing the\nnames or descriptions of substances or classes of substances),\nin substitution for the current Poisons Standard.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-52d"
      },
