      "cof:title": "52D(2) Poisons Standard",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 343,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to this Act and the regulations, the Secretary may:\n(a) amend the current Poisons Standard; or\n(b) prepare a document (including schedules containing the\nnames or descriptions of substances or classes of substances),\nin substitution for the current Poisons Standard."
    },
