      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.343",
      "values:originalText": "(4A) An instrument made under paragraph (2)(a) or (b) after the\ncommencement of this subsection is a legislative instrument, but\nsection 42 (disallowance) of the Legislation Act 2003 does not\napply to the instrument.",
      "skos:definition": "(4A) An instrument made under paragraph (2)(a) or (b) after the\ncommencement of this subsection is a legislative instrument, but\nsection 42 (disallowance) of the Legislation Act 2003 does not\napply to the instrument.",
