    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-52d-ss-4b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "52D(4B) Poisons Standard",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-52d-ss-4b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.343",
      "values:originalText": "(4B) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, an instrument\nmade under paragraph (2)(a) or (b) of this section may make\nprovision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or\nincorporating any matter contained in an instrument or other\nwriting as in force or existing from time to time.",
      "skos:definition": "(4B) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, an instrument\nmade under paragraph (2)(a) or (b) of this section may make\nprovision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or\nincorporating any matter contained in an instrument or other\nwriting as in force or existing from time to time.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-52d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-52d-ss-4b-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8cfcb722de9b3356b537cfc747c70a2466e075f1d0ea855654590583ade337e1",
      "skos:note": "Allows for incorporation of existing provisions from other instruments or writings."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-52d-ss-4b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "52D(4B) Poisons Standard",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 343,
      "values:originalText": "(4B) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, an instrument\nmade under paragraph (2)(a) or (b) of this section may make\nprovision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or\nincorporating any matter contained in an instrument or other\nwriting as in force or existing from time to time."
    },
