      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.343",
      "values:originalText": "(5) In this section:\namend, in relation to the current Poisons Standard, means:\n\nChapter 6  Administration",
      "skos:definition": "(5) In this section:\namend, in relation to the current Poisons Standard, means:\n\nChapter 6  Administration",
