      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.344",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In exercising a power under subsection 52D(2), the Secretary may\nseek advice from either or both of the following:\n\nAdministration  Chapter 6\nScheduling of substances  Part 6-3\n\nSection 52EAA\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(a) any committee that the Secretary considers appropriate\n(whether or not the committee is established under this Act or\nthe regulations);\n(b) any person.",
