      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.348",
      "values:originalText": "If a jury acquits a person of an offence against a provision listed in\ncolumn 2 of an item in the following table, but is satisfied beyond\nreasonable doubt of facts that prove that the person is guilty of the\noffence listed in column 3 of that item, the jury may convict the\nperson of the offence listed in column 3 of that item:\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 7\n\nSection 53A\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nAlternative verdicts for various offences\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\nColumn 3\nItem\nIf a prosecution is for\nan offence against...\nthe jury may instead\nconvict the person of an\noffence against...\n1A\nsubsection 9G(1)\nsubsection 9G(4)\nsubsection 14(1)\nsubsection 14(4)\nsubsection 14(6)\nsubsection 14(9)\nsubsection 14(10)\nsubsection 14(13)\nsubsection 15(2)\nsubsection 15(5)\nsubsection 19B(1)\nsubsection 19B(4)\nsubsection 21A(1)\nsubsection 21A(4)\nsubsection 21A(5)\nsubsection 21A(8)\nsubsection 21A(9)\nsubsection 21A(9A)\n8A\nsubsection 21A(11A)\nsubsection 21A(11C)\nsubsection 21A(12)\nsubsection 21A(12A)\n9A\nsubsection 22(2)\nsubsection 22(3)\n9B\nsubsection 22(6)\nsubsection 22(7)\nsubsection 22A(1)\nsubsection 22A(4)\nsubsection 30EC(1)\nsubsection 30EC(4)\nsubsection 30F(4B)\nsubsection 30F(5)\nsubsection 31(5A)\nsubsection 31(6)\n13A\nsubsection 32BA(1)\nsubsection 32BA(4)\n13B\nsubsection 32BB(1)\nsubsection 32BB(4)\n13C\nsubsection 32BC(1)\nsubsection 32BC(4)\n13D\nsubsection 32BD(1)\nsubsection 32BD(4)\n13E\nsubsection 32BI(1)\nsubsection 32BI(4)\n13EA\nsubsection 32BJ(2A)\nsubsection 32BJ(2B)\n13EB\nsubsection 32CJ(6)\nsubsection 32CJ(7)\n13F\nsubsection 32CN(1)\nsubsection 32CN(4)\n13FA\nsubsection 32CN(5)\nsubsection 32CN(7)\n\nChapter 7  Miscellaneous\n\nSection 53A\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nAlternative verdicts for various offences\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\nColumn 3\nItem\nIf a prosecution is for\nan offence against...\nthe jury may instead\nconvict the person 