        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-54-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-54-ss-3-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b4d20fb3979fffa9c593a6f547a01886430c38fae5425b12736b6ec7f8315889",
      "skos:note": "Forfeiture of goods in relation to therapeutic or vaping products"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-54-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54(3) Offences and forfeiture",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 351,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If a court:\n(a) convicts a person of an offence against this Act; or\n(aa) makes an order under section 19B of the Crimes Act 1914 in\nrespect of a person charged with an offence against this Act;\nor\n(b) orders a person to pay a pecuniary penalty for the\ncontravention of a civil penalty provision;\nin relation to any therapeutic goods or vaping goods, the court may\norder that the goods be forfeited to the Commonwealth and, if an\norder is made, the goods become the property of the\nCommonwealth."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-54-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-54-ss-3"
      },
