      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.351",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Goods forfeited under an order referred to in subsection (3) are to\nbe disposed of in such manner as the Secretary directs.\nNote:\nSee also Part 6-2A, which provides for forfeiture of things seized in\ncertain circumstances.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Goods forfeited under an order referred to in subsection (3) are to\nbe disposed of in such manner as the Secretary directs.\nNote:\nSee also Part 6-2A, which provides for forfeiture of things seized in\ncertain circumstances.",
      "values:partOf": {
