      "skos:note": "Goods forfeited under an order must be disposed of in a manner specified by the Secretary."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-54-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54(5) Offences and forfeiture",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 351,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Goods forfeited under an order referred to in subsection (3) are to\nbe disposed of in such manner as the Secretary directs.\nNote:\nSee also Part 6-2A, which provides for forfeiture of things seized in\ncertain circumstances."
    },
    {
