      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.352",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If subsection (2) does not apply, the number of penalty units for the\ncontravention is 50 penalty units.\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 7\n\nSection 54AB\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If subsection (2) does not apply, the number of penalty units for the\ncontravention is 50 penalty units.\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 7\n\nSection 54AB\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025",
