    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-54b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "54B(2) Personal liability of an executive officer of a body corporate—",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-54b-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.354",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The maximum penalty for an offence against subsection (1) is:\n(a) the maximum penalty that a court could impose in respect of\nan individual for the offence committed by the body\ncorporate; or\n(b) if the offence committed by the body corporate is an offence\nagainst subsection 41MN(10)—imprisonment for 5 years or\n4,000 penalty units, or both.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The maximum penalty for an offence against subsection (1) is:\n(a) the maximum penalty that a court could impose in respect of\nan individual for the offence committed by the body\ncorporate; or\n(b) if the offence committed by the body corporate is an offence\nagainst subsection 41MN(10)—imprisonment for 5 years or\n4,000 penalty units, or both.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-54b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-54b-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c982497a7430d06e5217d1b39e0558b2eeb8dfb9cc00cb6fe651fdd4402b6df6",
      "skos:note": "Maximum penalty for an offence against subsection (1)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-54b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "54B(2) Personal liability of an executive officer of a body corporate—",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 354,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The maximum penalty for an offence against subsection (1) is:\n(a) the maximum penalty that a court could impose in respect of\nan individual for the offence committed by the body\ncorporate; or\n(b) if the offence committed by the body corporate is an offence\nagainst subsection 41MN(10)—imprisonment for 5 years or\n4,000 penalty units, or both."
    },
