      "cml:integrityHash": "4a5dd28e2e5fcac2aae9459756af00e2fd4e93533bedc8dce0bf41c41c709a3d",
      "skos:note": "Delegation of powers to registered medical or dental practitioners or pharmacists."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-57-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57(2) Delegation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 364,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The powers of the Secretary under paragraph 19(1)(a), 32CK(1)(d)\nor 41HB(1)(d) may be delegated under subsection (1) only to a\nperson referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (c) who is registered, or\neligible for registration, in a State or internal Territory, as a\nmedical or dental practitioner or as a pharmacist."
    },
