    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "57(3) Delegation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-57-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.364",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to the regulations, the Secretary may, in such\ncircumstances as are prescribed, by signed instrument, delegate all\nor any of his or her powers under paragraph 19(1)(a), 32CK(1)(d)\nor 41HB(1)(d) to a person who is registered, in a State or internal\nTerritory, as a medical or dental practitioner.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Subject to the regulations, the Secretary may, in such\ncircumstances as are prescribed, by signed instrument, delegate all\nor any of his or her powers under paragraph 19(1)(a), 32CK(1)(d)\nor 41HB(1)(d) to a person who is registered, in a State or internal\nTerritory, as a medical or dental practitioner.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "24160bd133701d3c7ee9b5ecff86e6e53e6b1807382bdd963f523aead20b6e78",
      "skos:note": "Delegation of powers by Secretary to registered medical or dental practitioner"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-57-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57(3) Delegation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 364,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subject to the regulations, the Secretary may, in such\ncircumstances as are prescribed, by signed instrument, delegate all\nor any of his or her powers under paragraph 19(1)(a), 32CK(1)(d)\nor 41HB(1)(d) to a person who is registered, in a State or internal\nTerritory, as a medical or dental practitioner."
    },
