    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "57(4) Delegation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-57-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.364",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A delegate under subsection (3) is, in the exercise of a delegated\npower, subject to the directions of:\n(a) the Secretary; or\n(b) an officer of the Department authorised in writing by the\nSecretary; or\n(c) a person referred to in paragraph (1)(c).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A delegate under subsection (3) is, in the exercise of a delegated\npower, subject to the directions of:\n(a) the Secretary; or\n(b) an officer of the Department authorised in writing by the\nSecretary; or\n(c) a person referred to in paragraph (1)(c).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d98b15dd8fb83caac1a8624ba46484b2d0b49edc0b8f1dde3dfd30828092b298",
      "skos:note": "Delegate must follow directions from Secretary, officer, or person referred to in paragraph (1)(c)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-57-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57(4) Delegation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 364,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A delegate under subsection (3) is, in the exercise of a delegated\npower, subject to the directions of:\n(a) the Secretary; or\n(b) an officer of the Department authorised in writing by the\nSecretary; or\n(c) a person referred to in paragraph (1)(c)."
    },
