      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.364",
      "values:originalText": "(5A) The powers of the Secretary under subsection 19(5) may be\ndelegated only to a person referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (c) of\nthis section who is registered, or eligible for registration, in a State\n\nChapter 7  Miscellaneous\n\nSection 57\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nor internal Territory as a medical or dental practitioner or as a\npharmacist.",
      "skos:definition": "(5A) The powers of the Secretary under subsection 19(5) may be\ndelegated only to a person referred to in paragraph (1)(a) or (c) of\nthis section who is registered, or eligible for registration, in a State\n\nChapter 7  Miscellaneous\n\nSection 57\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nor internal Territory as a medical or dental practitioner or as a\npharmacist.",
