      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.364",
      "values:originalText": "(10) The power of the Minister under subsection 18A(1) or 41P(3) may\nbe delegated only to:\n(a) the Secretary; or\n(b) an SES employee who holds, or performs the duties of, an\nSES Band 3 position in the Department; or\n(c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as\na medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties\nof, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES\nBand 2 position in the Department.\n(10AA) The power of the Minister under subsection 30EK(1) may be\ndelegated only to:\n(a) the Secretary; or\n(b) an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the\nDepartment; or\n(c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as\na medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 7\n\nSection 58\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nof, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES\nBand 2 position in the Department.",
      "skos:definition": "(10) The power of the Minister under subsection 18A(1) or 41P(3) may\nbe delegated only to:\n(a) the Secretary; or\n(b) an SES employee who holds, or performs the duties of, an\nSES Band 3 position in the Department; or\n(c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as\na medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties\nof, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES\nBand 2 position in the Department.\n(10AA) The power of the Minister under subsection 30EK(1) may be\ndelegated only to:\n(a) the Secretary; or\n(b) an SES employee, or acting SES employee, in the\nDepartment; or\n(c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as\na medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 7\n\nSection 58\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nof, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES\nBand 2 position in the Department.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
