    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57-ss-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "57(11) Delegation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-57-ss-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.364",
      "values:originalText": "(11) The power of the Minister under subsection 41GS(1) may be\ndelegated only to:\n(a) the Secretary; or\n(b) an SES employee who holds, or performs the duties of, an\nSES Band 3 position in the Department; or\n(c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as\na medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties\nof, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES\nBand 2 position in the Department.\nDelegate must comply with directions",
      "skos:definition": "(11) The power of the Minister under subsection 41GS(1) may be\ndelegated only to:\n(a) the Secretary; or\n(b) an SES employee who holds, or performs the duties of, an\nSES Band 3 position in the Department; or\n(c) a person who is registered, in a State or internal Territory, as\na medical practitioner and who holds, or performs the duties\nof, a position that is equivalent to, or higher than, an SES\nBand 2 position in the Department.\nDelegate must comply with directions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-57-ss-11-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a62d340868c024869b38cb76ff49a667bae546bc027ef2c545716b79d5ab1e5f",
      "skos:note": "Delegation of power to specific individuals or positions."
    },
    {
