    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-60",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "60 Review of decisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-60"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.368",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this section and section 60A:\ndecision has the same meaning as in the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024.\ninitial decision means a decision of the Secretary or of a delegate\nof the Secretary:\n(aa) under subsection 7C(3); or\n(ab) under section 9C, 9D or 9F; or\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 7\n\nSection 60\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(b) refusing to grant, or imposing conditions on a grant of, a\nconsent under section 14 or 14A; or\n(c) under Part 3-2 (registration and listing of therapeutic goods),\nother than a decision under paragraph 26BE(4)(a), or a\ndecision under subsection 26BJ(8), to make a\nrecommendation; or\n(ca) under Part 3-2A (Biologicals); or\n(d) under Part 3-3 (manufacturing of therapeutic goods); or\n(e) under Part 4-4 (conformity assessment certificates); or\n(f) under Part 4-5 (including medical devices in the Register),\nother than:\n(i) a decision under section 41FH (selecting applications\nfor auditing); or\n(ii) a decision about which aspects of the matters referred to\nin paragraphs 41FI(1)(a) and (b) to consider in auditing\nan application under Subdivision C of Division 1 of",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this section and section 60A:\ndecision has the same meaning as in the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024.\ninitial decision means a decision of the Secretary or of a delegate\nof the Secretary:\n(aa) under subsection 7C(3); or\n(ab) under section 9C, 9D or 9F; or\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 7\n\nSection 60\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(b) refusing to grant, or imposing conditions on a grant of, a\nconsent under section 14 or 14A; or\n(c) under Part 3-2 (registration and listing of therapeutic goods),\nother than a decision under paragraph 26BE(4)(a), or a\ndecision under subsection 26BJ(8), to make a\nrecommendation; or\n(ca) under Part 3-2A (Biologicals); or\n(d) under Part 3-3 (manufacturing of therapeutic goods); or\n(e) under Part 4-4 (conformity assessment certificates); or\n(f) under Part 4-5 (including medical devices in the Register),\nother than:\n(i) a decision under section 41FH (selecting applications\nfor auditing); or\n(ii) a decision about which aspects of the matters referred to\nin paragraphs 41FI(1)(a) and (b) to consider in auditing\nan application under Subdivision C of Division 1 of",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-60-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-60-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-60-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4a47d81bbcbfe5270c94b80c8cb991dfab670ee5ade11c0fc8af53ad09234f65",
      "skos:note": "Refusal to grant consent or impose conditions on a grant of consent under section 14 or 14A."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-60",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60 Review of decisions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 368,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this section and section 60A:\ndecision has the same meaning as in the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024.\ninitial decision means a decision of the Secretary or of a delegate\nof the Secretary:\n(aa) under subsection 7C(3); or\n(ab) under section 9C, 9D or 9F; or\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 7\n\nSection 60\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(b) refusing to grant, or imposing conditions on a grant of, a\nconsent under section 14 or 14A; or\n(c) under Part 3-2 (registration and listing of therapeutic goods),\nother than a decision under paragraph 26BE(4)(a), or a\ndecision under subsection 26BJ(8), to make a\nrecommendation; or\n(ca) under Part 3-2A (Biologicals); or\n(d) under Part 3-3 (manufacturing of therapeutic goods); or\n(e) under Part 4-4 (conformity assessment certificates); or\n(f) under Part 4-5 (including medical devices in the Register),\nother than:\n(i) a decision under section 41FH (selecting applications\nfor auditing); or\n(ii) a decision about which aspects of the matters referred to\nin paragraphs 41FI(1)(a) and (b) to consider in auditing\nan application under Subdivision C of Division 1 of"
    },
