    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-60a-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "60A(8) New information on review—discretion to remit",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-60a-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.374",
      "values:originalText": "(8) In this section:\nauthorised delegate means a delegate of the Secretary:\n(a) exercising a power to decide whether to register therapeutic\ngoods; or\n(aa) exercising a power to decide whether to include a biological\nin the Register; or\n(b) exercising a power to decide whether to issue a conformity\nassessment certificate.\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 7\n\nSection 61\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\ninitial new information means information that:\n(a) was in existence at the time the decision referred to in\nsubsection (1) was made; and\n(b) was not made available to the Secretary or authorised\ndelegate for the purpose of making that decision; and\n(c) is relevant to that decision;\nand includes any opinions that are wholly or substantially based on\nsuch information (whether the opinions were formed before or\nafter that decision was made).\nlater new information means information that:\n(a) was in existence at the time the decision on reconsideration\nwas made; and\n(b) was not made available to the Minister or delegate of the\nMinister for the purpose of making that decision; and\n(c) is relevant to that decision;\nand includes any opinions that are wholly or substantially based on\nsuch information (whether the opinions were formed before or\nafter that decision was made).",
      "skos:definition": "(8) In this section:\nauthorised delegate means a delegate of the Secretary:\n(a) exercising a power to decide whether to register therapeutic\ngoods; or\n(aa) exercising a power to decide whether to include a biological\nin the Register; or\n(b) exercising a power to decide whether to issue a conformity\nassessment certificate.\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 7\n\nSection 61\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\ninitial new information means information that:\n(a) was in existence at the time the decision referred to in\nsubsection (1) was made; and\n(b) was not made available to the Secretary or authorised\ndelegate for the purpose of making that decision; and\n(c) is relevant to that decision;\nand includes any opinions that are wholly or substantially based on\nsuch information (whether the opinions were formed before or\nafter that decision was made).\nlater new information means information that:\n(a) was in existence at the time the decision on reconsideration\nwas made; and\n(b) was not made available to the Minister or delegate of the\nMinister for the purpose of making that decision; and\n(c) is relevant to that decision;\nand includes any opinions that are wholly or substantially based on\nsuch information (whether the opinions were formed before or\nafter that decision was made).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-60a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-60a-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-60a-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-60a-ss-8-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6d03ed07cd7b49ecbde9a6764bf00666f56d57ebc614c4b8fe44e5bfe24caaaa",
      "skos:note": "Defines authorized delegate and conditions for new information."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-60a-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60A(8) New information on review—discretion to remit",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 374,
      "values:originalText": "(8) In this section:\nauthorised delegate means a delegate of the Secretary:\n(a) exercising a power to decide whether to register therapeutic\ngoods; or\n(aa) exercising a power to decide whether to include a biological\nin the Register; or\n(b) exercising a power to decide whether to issue a conformity\nassessment certificate.\n\nMiscellaneous  Chapter 7\n\nSection 61\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\ninitial new information means information that:\n(a) was in existence at the time the decision referred to in\nsubsection (1) was made; and\n(b) was not made available to the Secretary or authorised\ndelegate for the purpose of making that decision; and\n(c) is relevant to that decision;\nand includes any opinions that are wholly or substantially based on\nsuch information (whether the opinions were formed before or\nafter that decision was made).\nlater new information means information that:\n(a) was in existence at the time the decision on reconsideration\nwas made; and\n(b) was not made available to the Minister or delegate of the\nMinister for the purpose of making that decision; and\n(c) is relevant to that decision;\nand includes any opinions that are wholly or substantially based on\nsuch information (whether the opinions were formed before or\nafter that decision was made)."
    },
    {
