      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.385",
      "values:originalText": "(1) No civil action, suit or proceeding lies against:\n(a) the Commonwealth; or\n(b) a protected person;\nin respect of loss, damage or injury of any kind suffered by another\nperson as a result of anything done, or omitted to be done, by a\nprotected person in relation to the performance or purported\nperformance, or in relation to the exercise or purported exercise, of\na protected person’s functions, duties or powers under this Act or\nthe regulations.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) No civil action, suit or proceeding lies against:\n(a) the Commonwealth; or\n(b) a protected person;\nin respect of loss, damage or injury of any kind suffered by another\nperson as a result of anything done, or omitted to be done, by a\nprotected person in relation to the performance or purported\nperformance, or in relation to the exercise or purported exercise, of\na protected person’s functions, duties or powers under this Act or\nthe regulations.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-61a"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-61a-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-61a-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4926f889f969b3fb1954bdec92d7ab50aa05fc23f7deacab40d1eba93cd9f8d0",
      "skos:note": "No civil action against Commonwealth or protected person for loss/damage/injury caused by their actions."
    },
