      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.386",
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of section 2, regulations may be made before the\ncommencement of this Act as if this Act were in force, but do not\ncome into effect on a day earlier than the day on which this Act\ncommences.\n\nChapter 8  Repeal and transitional provisions\n\nSection 66\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nChapter 8—Repeal and transitional\nprovisions",
      "skos:definition": "(5) For the purposes of section 2, regulations may be made before the\ncommencement of this Act as if this Act were in force, but do not\ncome into effect on a day earlier than the day on which this Act\ncommences.\n\nChapter 8  Repeal and transitional provisions\n\nSection 66\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\nChapter 8—Repeal and transitional\nprovisions",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-63"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
