    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-4a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "66(4A) Transitional arrangements for goods required to be registered or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-66-ss-4a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.390",
      "values:originalText": "(4A) In relation to an evaluation conducted for the purposes of this\nsection:\n(a) section 25 has effect as if:\n(i) the person in respect of whom the goods are registered\nwere an applicant for the registration of the goods; and\n(ii) the reference in paragraph (1)(b) to an evaluation fee\nunder section 24 were a reference to a fee payable under\nsubsection (4) of this section; and\n(b) sections 24A, 24B and 24C have effect as if any reference in\nthose sections to section 24 were a reference to subsection (4)\nof this section; and\n\nChapter 8  Repeal and transitional provisions\n\nSection 67\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(c) sections 24D and 24E do not apply.",
      "skos:definition": "(4A) In relation to an evaluation conducted for the purposes of this\nsection:\n(a) section 25 has effect as if:\n(i) the person in respect of whom the goods are registered\nwere an applicant for the registration of the goods; and\n(ii) the reference in paragraph (1)(b) to an evaluation fee\nunder section 24 were a reference to a fee payable under\nsubsection (4) of this section; and\n(b) sections 24A, 24B and 24C have effect as if any reference in\nthose sections to section 24 were a reference to subsection (4)\nof this section; and\n\nChapter 8  Repeal and transitional provisions\n\nSection 67\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(c) sections 24D and 24E do not apply.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-4a-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a83342b417c93b94a4679b8fcec0267e5d9a519f0d8822abfd5bc9ee8f79d95a",
      "skos:note": "Transitional arrangements for goods required to be registered or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-66-ss-4a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "66(4A) Transitional arrangements for goods required to be registered or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 390,
      "values:originalText": "(4A) In relation to an evaluation conducted for the purposes of this\nsection:\n(a) section 25 has effect as if:\n(i) the person in respect of whom the goods are registered\nwere an applicant for the registration of the goods; and\n(ii) the reference in paragraph (1)(b) to an evaluation fee\nunder section 24 were a reference to a fee payable under\nsubsection (4) of this section; and\n(b) sections 24A, 24B and 24C have effect as if any reference in\nthose sections to section 24 were a reference to subsection (4)\nof this section; and\n\nChapter 8  Repeal and transitional provisions\n\nSection 67\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(c) sections 24D and 24E do not apply."
    },
