    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-4b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "66(4B) Transitional arrangements for goods required to be registered or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-66-ss-4b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.390",
      "values:originalText": "(4B) If, on an application under subsection (3), goods have been listed\nwithout consideration of the matters mentioned in paragraphs\n26(1)(c) to (m), the Secretary may, if he or she thinks it\nappropriate, give the person in relation to whom the goods are\nlisted written notice that the Secretary intends to determine\nwhether the goods should continue to be listed.",
      "skos:definition": "(4B) If, on an application under subsection (3), goods have been listed\nwithout consideration of the matters mentioned in paragraphs\n26(1)(c) to (m), the Secretary may, if he or she thinks it\nappropriate, give the person in relation to whom the goods are\nlisted written notice that the Secretary intends to determine\nwhether the goods should continue to be listed.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-4b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-4b-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a853016961d6852efc6a6f597a7ba46c15cc85220711dbafce77f7475ff9e2cf",
      "skos:note": "Secretary may give written notice to person listed goods"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-66-ss-4b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "66(4B) Transitional arrangements for goods required to be registered or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 390,
      "values:originalText": "(4B) If, on an application under subsection (3), goods have been listed\nwithout consideration of the matters mentioned in paragraphs\n26(1)(c) to (m), the Secretary may, if he or she thinks it\nappropriate, give the person in relation to whom the goods are\nlisted written notice that the Secretary intends to determine\nwhether the goods should continue to be listed."
    },
