      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.390",
      "values:originalText": "(4C) If notice is given under subsection (4B), section 26 applies as if the\nperson in relation to whom the goods are listed were an applicant\nfor the listing of the goods.",
      "skos:definition": "(4C) If notice is given under subsection (4B), section 26 applies as if the\nperson in relation to whom the goods are listed were an applicant\nfor the listing of the goods.",
      "values:partOf": {
