      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "66(6) Transitional arrangements for goods required to be registered or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-66-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.390",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Where a person suffers any kind of loss, damage or injury caused\nby, or arising out of, the use by the person of therapeutic goods to\nwhich this section applies, no liability in respect of that loss,\ndamage or injury attaches to the Commonwealth, the Secretary or\nany delegate of the Secretary.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Where a person suffers any kind of loss, damage or injury caused\nby, or arising out of, the use by the person of therapeutic goods to\nwhich this section applies, no liability in respect of that loss,\ndamage or injury attaches to the Commonwealth, the Secretary or\nany delegate of the Secretary.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-logic-ltl-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-logic-deontic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dfe2cef4144e62d12e2390015d8f9196825bbfad17e5ec8411815f65b0b475bb",
      "skos:note": "No liability attaches to Commonwealth, Secretary, or delegate for losses caused by therapeutic goods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-66-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "66(6) Transitional arrangements for goods required to be registered or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 390,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Where a person suffers any kind of loss, damage or injury caused\nby, or arising out of, the use by the person of therapeutic goods to\nwhich this section applies, no liability in respect of that loss,\ndamage or injury attaches to the Commonwealth, the Secretary or\nany delegate of the Secretary."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Implies",
      "cml:logicSummary": "No liability implies loss or damage",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Loss or damage occurs",
      "cml:conclusionText": "No liability attaches"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-logic-descriptionlogic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "SubClassOf",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Therapeutic goods are a subclass of goods subject to this section",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::dl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "This section applies to therapeutic goods",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Loss or damage is covered by this section"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Implies",
      "cml:logicSummary": "No liability implies lack of responsibility",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Lack of liability implies no responsibility",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Commonwealth, Secretary, or delegate is not responsible for losses"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-logic-ltl-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Until",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Liability attaches until loss or damage is covered by this section",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Loss or damage occurs before this section applies",
      "cml:conclusionText": "No liability attaches until this section applies"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-66-ss-6-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Implies",
      "cml:logicSummary": "This section implies a duty to provide compensation for losses caused by therapeutic goods",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Losses are caused by therapeutic goods subject to this section",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Commonwealth, Secretary, or delegate must provide compensation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-67",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "67 Transitional provision for therapeutic goods for export only",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-67"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.392",
      "values:originalText": "Section 20 does not apply, during the period of 6 months after the\ncommencement of this Act, to therapeutic goods manufactured in\nAustralia solely for export from Australia.",
      "skos:definition": "Section 20 does not apply, during the period of 6 months after the\ncommencement of this Act, to therapeutic goods manufactured in\nAustralia solely for export from Australia.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-67-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2e3de76f5908db2170ad3e585ad6d5eb47b79a8afdb9a8405458cd8ad7277a88",
      "skos:note": "Therapeutic goods manufactured in Australia solely for export from Australia are exempt from Section 20 during the first 6 months after commencement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-67",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "67 Transitional provision for therapeutic goods for export only",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 392,
      "values:originalText": "Section 20 does not apply, during the period of 6 months after the\ncommencement of this Act, to therapeutic goods manufactured in\nAustralia solely for export from Australia."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-67-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-67"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-68",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "68 Transitional arrangements for Part 3-3",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/therapeutic-goods-act-1989#sec-68"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "therapeutic-goods-act-1989.pdf, p.392",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies to a step in the manufacture of therapeutic\ngoods in relation to a person in relation to premises in Australia if,\nbefore the commencement of this Act, the person was carrying out\nthat step in relation to goods of that kind at those premises.\n\nRepeal and transitional provisions  Chapter 8\n\nSection 69\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(2) Where:\n(a) this section applies to a step in the manufacture of therapeutic\ngoods in relation to a person in relation to premises; and\n(b) the Secretary is not aware of the person having been\nconvicted of an offence against a law of the Commonwealth,\nof a State or of an internal Territory in respect of goods of\nthat kind during the period of 2 years ending on the\ncommencement of this Act;\nsubsection 35(1) does not apply the carrying out of that step by the\nperson in relation to goods of that kind at those premises during the\nperiod of 4 months after that commencement.\n(3) Where:\n(a) this section applies to a step in the manufacture of therapeutic\ngoods in relation to a person in relation to premises; and\n(b) the person makes an application for a licence to carry out that\nstep in relation to goods of that kind at those premises in\naccordance with section 37 and within 4 months after the\ncommencement of this Act;\nsubsection 35(1) does not apply to the carrying out of that step by\nthe person in relation to goods of that kind at those premises until\nthe application is determined.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies to a step in the manufacture of therapeutic\ngoods in relation to a person in relation to premises in Australia if,\nbefore the commencement of this Act, the person was carrying out\nthat step in relation to goods of that kind at those premises.\n\nRepeal and transitional provisions  Chapter 8\n\nSection 69\nTherapeutic Goods Act 1989\nCompilation date: 05/09/2025\n(2) Where:\n(a) this section applies to a step in the manufacture of therapeutic\ngoods in relation to a person in relation to premises; and\n(b) the Secretary is not aware of the person having been\nconvicted of an offence against a law of the Commonwealth,\nof a State or of an internal Territory in respect of goods of\nthat kind during the period of 2 years ending on the\ncommencement of this Act;\nsubsection 35(1) does not apply the carrying out of that step by the\nperson in relation to goods of that kind at those premises during the\nperiod of 4 months after that commencement.\n(3) Where:\n(a) this section applies to a step in the manufacture of therapeutic\ngoods in relation to a person in relation to premises; and\n(b) the person makes an application for a licence to carry out that\nstep in relation to goods of that kind at those premises in\naccordance with section 37 and within 4 months after the\ncommencement of this Act;\nsubsection 35(1) does not apply to the carrying out of that step by\nthe person in relation to goods of that kind at those premises until\nthe application is determined.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-68-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:therapeutic-goods-act-1989-sec-68-ss-2"
        },
